<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Nguu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitabu cha Nk'hongo cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Samw</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kitabu cha nk'hongo cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="mt1">SAMWELI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOELO</para>
  <para style="ip">Aho nk'hongo vitabu va Samweli cha nk'hongo na cha kaidi vandaga ni kitabu kimwenga kikulu chamanyikaga enga, Kitabu cha Samweli. Kitabu iki chapangwagwa haidi mwo utapita we Kigiliki we Ndagano ya Kale. Mwo utapita uno we Kigiliki, Kitabu cha nk'hongo cha Samweli ne kitabu cha kaidi cha Samweli, chetangwagwa, Useuta wa nk'hongo na wa kaidi, naho mwe Bibilia ye Kilatini vetangwagwa Maseuta wa Nk'hongo na wa Kaidi hamwenga ne vitabu va Maseuta, vetengwagwa Maseuta wa katatu na maseuta wa kane. Vitabu va nk'hongo va Samweli, na vitabu va kaidi, vilongesa mwo wikazi wa mlotezi Samweli, seuta Sauli na seuta Daudi. Samweli niye andaga kilongozi azigiile mwo lupisi umwo Waizilaeli wasagukaga kulawa mwo kulongozwa ni walamuzi niyo walongozwa ni maseuta. Naho Samweli awakumbaga mavuta Sauli na Daudi kunda maseuta waidi wa nk'hongo wa Izilaeli. Vitabu va nk'hongo va Samweli na vitabu va kaidi va Samweli vatambalisa Mbuli zomboke za Waizilaeli mwo lupisi ludya. Hehali yeyose ammanyaga uyo awandikaga vitabu ivo. Awandike haketambule mwenye mwe kitabu icho, mna ekalaga mpaka mwo lupisi lwa seuta Daudi, na lupisi lugendeele mpaka aho hawandikwagwa kaidi zimbuli za Sauli na Samweli. Kwajili ye kinyele mwa uyo muwandishi ywe vitabu ivi haimanyike kugamba vawandikwagwa ini.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani kitabu cha Samweli ywa kaidi 1 Walonga ivo Daudi andaga seuta ywa Yuda na akajika niyo anda Seuta ywa Izilaeli yose. Mnango 1-5 2 Walonga ivo Daudi ekalaga kunda seuta na kuwakoma wank'hondo wakwe wengi. Mnango 6-10 3 Chaona ivo Daudi atendaga uhabwasi na ukomi niyo ativilwa ni mlotezi Natani. Mnango wa 11-12 4 Chawaona awant'hu waidi wasaguke kwa Daudi. Mnango wa 13-20 5 Ihanganya zimbuli zose za Daudi mwo useuta wakwe. Mnango 22-24</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi agambilwa file ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Sauli eze ande kabanika kale, Daudi auyaga akanda kawahuma kale Waamaleki, niyo akwikala uko Sikilagi kwa lupisi lwa mazuwa maidi. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Mwe dizuwa dya katatu, mnt'hu yumwenga kulawa mwe nk'hambi ya Sauli, akanda kazitatula zisuke zakwe kwa usungu naho kakegela luvumbi kwo mtwi, ambasaga Daudi. Eze ambwiile, akedulaga hasi niyo afunamiza mtwi wakwe kwa kumtunya. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Kulawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Uyo mnt'hu niyo amhitula, “Hinyilika mwe nk'hambi ya Izilaeli.” <verse eid="2SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Niyo naho Daudi amuuza, “Kuna mbwai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Yudya mnt'hu niyo amhitula, “Want'hu wetu wanyilika kwe nk'hondo naho watowani wengi wakomigwa, mwa want'hu awo ni hamwenga na Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani.” <verse eid="2SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Daudi niyo amuuza yudya mnt'hu, “Kumanya vivihi kugamba Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani wakomwa?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Yudya mbwanga ahitulaga akagamba, “Miye nehinda kwo mnima wa Giliboa uko kwandile ne nk'hondo. Nehimuona Sauli kegamila mjungo wakwe naho magali yakwe ye wank'hondo yandaga hagihi naye. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Sauli eze asinye kunyuma, anionaga niyo anitanga, nize nitike, <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />aniuzaga kugamba ni miye ani, name niyo namgamba miye ni Mmaleki. <verse eid="2SA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />Aho niyo anigamba nimsogeele vileke hamkome! kwaviya kalumiziswa naho ehagihi na kubanika. <verse eid="2SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />Ivo, nehimsogeela hagihi niyo namkoma, kwaviya nehimanya kugamba anagwa hasi naabanike du. Naho taji yandile mwo mtwi wakwe no mkowa wandile mwo mkono wakwe, vose hikwigaila weye zumbe ywangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daudi hamwenga na want'hu wose andaga nawo wazitatulaga zisuke zawe kwa kulagisa kinyulu. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Wailaga na kuhongeza, naho wafungaga mpaka kisingi kwaajili ye file ya Sauli na Yonasani mwanawe, na Isi ya Waizilaeli awo want'hu wa Zumbe Mnungu, kwaviya wengi wawe nawakomigwa kwe nk'hondo.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi niyo amuuza yudya mbwanga amgambile zimbuli, “Weye kulawa hii?” Yehe niyo ahitula, “Miye ni Mmaleki, mna nekala mwe isi yako enga mta kwiza.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi niyo amuuza, “Neinda vivihi weye hwogohe kuchulula mkono wako na kumkoma mnt'hu asagulwe kwa ndima ya Zumbe Mnungu?” <verse eid="2SA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Ivo Daudi amwitangaga yumwenga mwa want'hu wakwe niyo amgamba, “Mkome mnt'hu uyu!” Yudya mnt'hu amtowaga yudya Muamaleki niyo amkoma, <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Mbuli ino yako mwenye, kwaviya kulonga mwenye kugamba kumkoma mnt'hu asagulwe kwa ndima ya Zumbe Mnungu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi ahongeza file ya Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Ivo Daudi akemaga wila wa kuwahongezela Sauli na mwanawe Yonasani mahongezo aya, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />enga ivo viwandikwe mwe kitabu cha Ashali kugamba, wana wa Yuda wahinizwe aya.<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Mwe vigulu va Izilaeli nuko wachinjilwe vilongozi wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Nivo wagwele wadahi wetu wa nk'hondo.<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />Msekuilonga imbuli ino mwo mzi wa Gati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">naho msekuwagambila mwe zisila za Ashekeloni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">msekuwatenda wana kike wa Kifilisiti wakanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">naho msekuwatenda wana kike wa want'hu hewemmanyize Mnungu waone kinyemi.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />Hokunde na fula hegu mnyuzu nouugwe mwe vigulu va Giliboa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">migunda yawe inde heeina kint'hu mazuwa yose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">Kwaviya uko niko nk'hindo yo mdahi igeligwe soni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">naho nk'hindo ya Sauli heigendeele kukumbwa mavuta naho.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Kwa sakame ya awo wakomigwe na kwa vimba va awo wata ludole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">Msale wa Yonasani hauwahonyaga wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">naho sime ya Sauli hayatugaga.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />Sauli na Yonasani, nawaungiswa vitendese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">wakanda mwe file na mwo ugima nawanda hamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Nawanda wahufu kujink'ha sumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">kindedi, nawanda na ludole kujink'ha simba.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />Nyuwe wana kike wa Izilaeli mwiileni sauli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">uyo awavalagani suke zink'hundu naho zikuwagila</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">naho awahambagani kwa mahambo ya zahabu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />Watowani wadahi wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">wakomigwa kwe nk'hondo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonasani kakomelwa kwe vigulu.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Naona kinyulu kwajili yako weye Yonasani ndugu yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">weye nehikuungisa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">nokunda mbwiyangu ywa kwehela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">ni wa kwehela kujink'ha lukunde lwa wavele.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />Watowani wadahi wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">naho vitoanilo vawe ve nk'hondo vibanangwa havina ndima.”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi katendwa kunda seuta ywa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Mbuli izo zize zajike, Daudi nakamlombeza Zumbe, akagamba, “Togola, nikwele niite mwe mzi umwenga mwe mizi ya Yuda?” Mnungu niyo amgamba ita! Daudi niyo amuuza, “niite mzi uhi?” Mnungu niyo amhitula. “ita mwe mzi wa Hebuloni?” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Ivo, Daudi nakakwela Hebuloni, hamwenga na wakaziwe waidi, Ahinoamu kulawa mwo mzi wa Yezileeli, na Abigaili, afiilwe ni mgosiwe, kulawa mwe mzi wa Kalmeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Nakawaguha want'hu wakwe, kila mnt'hu akanda na mp'huga yakwe, na woho watenda wikazi mnk'handa mwe mizi indile mnk'handa mwe Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Want'hu wa Yuda nawaita kwa Daudi uko Hebuloni wakamhaka mavuta ande seuta ywawe. Daudi eze eve kugamba want'hu wa Yabeshi uko Gileadi ni woho wammosele msanga Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />nakawasigila want'hu uko Yabeshi Gileadi, “Zumbe awavike kwaviya mlagisa lukunde lwenyu kwa Sauli mkulu wenyu, kwa kummosela msanga. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Haluse, Mnungu awatendele yedi na kunda mhuwilwa kwenyu. Miye name neniwatendele yedi kwaviya nyuwe nomtenda yedi. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Mna mnde mtogile na wahumi. Sauli seuta ywenyu kabanika, na want'hu wa Yuda wanisagulaga na kunikumba mavuta ninde seuta ywawe.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti atendigwa kunda seuta wa Izilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abineli mwana ywa Neli, mkulu wa watowani wa Sauli nakanda kamguha Ishibosheti mwana wa Sauli na kumwigala uko Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Uko, Abineli kasagulwa Ishibosheti kunda seuta ywa isi ya Gileadi na Asilia na Yezileeli na Ifulaimu na Benjamini na Izilaeli yose. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishibosheti nakanda na miyaka milongo mine eze akonge kuilongoza Izilaeli, na yehe nakailongoza kwa miyaka miidi. Mna kabila dya Yuda nawanda seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daudi nakanda seuta wa Yuda uko Hebuloni kwa lupisi lwa miyaka mfungate na nusu.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Izilaeli watowana na want'hu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abineli mwana ywa Neli, hamwenga na wakulu wa Ishibosheti, mwana wa Sauli, nawahauka Mahanaimu na kuita Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu mwana Seluya na wandima watuhu wa Daudi, nawafosa wadugane na Abineli na want'hu wandaga nawo uko kwe dikawa uko Gibeoni. Fyo dimwenga nt'hendelo imwenga ye dikawa, fyo dituhu nadyo dituhu nadyo nt'hendelo ya kaidi ye dikawa. <verse eid="2SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abineli niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Walekele wabwanga watoane ha meso yetu.” Yoabu niyo ahitula, “Haya.” <verse eid="2SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Wabwanga mlongo na waidi wa Ishibosheti mwana Sauli kulawa kwe kabila dya Benjamini niyo wasagulwa niyo naho wabwanga mlongo na waidi kulawa kwa Daudi nawo niyo wasagulwa. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Kila yumwenga nakamgwila mnk'hondo ywakwe mwo mtwi, niyo watungana sime, ivo wose waidi wagwa hasi niyo wabanika. Ivo, hant'hu aho hetangwa Hekiti Hazulimu. Hant'hu aho heaho uko Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Nk'hondo iyo yakulisaga zuwa diya, naye Abineli niyo ahumwa, na want'hu wa Izilaeli, ha meso ya wandima wa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Na wana watatu wa Seluya nawanda uko, Yoabu na Abishai na Asaheli. Naho uyo Asaheli nakagulukisa enga nt'wika. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Naye Asaheli kamtimila Abineli, na mwo kuwita kwakwe hahitukile mkono wa kulume hegu kumoso mwe kumtimila Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Ivo Abineli niyo akaula kunyuma yakwe, akagamba, “Ni weye Asaheli?” Niyo yehe ahitula, “Heiye ni miye.” <verse eid="2SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Ivo Abineli niyo amgambila, hituka mkono wa kulume hegu kumoso, ukamtoze yumwenga mwa wabwanga, uguhe vitoanilo vakwe. Mna Asheli hazumile kuhituka na kuleka kumtimila. <verse eid="2SA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Niho naho Abineli amgamba Asaheli, “Usekunitimila, hukomelei? Togola nenidahe vivihi kumkaula Yoabu nduguyo?” <verse eid="2SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Mna Asaheli halekaga kumgulusa, ivo Abimeli amjungaga Asaheli mwe zinda zakwe no mjungo wakwe kwa kunyuma niyo mjungo walawanya kwo mgongo. Asaheli agwaga ahadya niyo abanika, niyo kila mnt'hu akimalaga na kwehelwa eze abule hadya agweelaga Asaheli na kubanika. <verse eid="2SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Mna Yoabu na Abishai wakamtimila Abineli na umwo zuwa dyandaga dikaswa weze wabule kwo lugulu lwa Ama, kuita Gia, mwe sila ikuhinga kwe dijangwa dya Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini wakeduganya hamwenga mwa Abineli, wakanda bunga dimwenga wakakimala mnanga mwo lugulu. <verse eid="2SA 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Niho uyu Abineli amwitanga Yoabu, niyo agamba, “Togola nekigendeele kutowana mazua yose? Humanyize kugamba kulongole hukunde kwedi? Ni ini nouwagambe want'hu wako waleke kukikulumbuza?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu naye niyo ahitula, nakelisa kwa Zumbe Mnungu, “Uneva hwalongile, want'hu hegu nawagendeela kuwagulusa want'hu wa seuta ywawe hegu hawalekile mpaka mtondo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ivo Yoabu niyo atoa gunda, na want'hu wose niyo wakimala, hawatimile Izilaeli, naho hawatoane. <verse eid="2SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Kilo icho chose Abineli na watowani wakwe wombokelaga Alaba na kudendeluka mto Yolodani, wakagenddeela komboka Bitoli yose mpaka Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Niyo Yoabu auya kwo kumtimila Abineli, na eze ajike kuwaduganya watowani wakwe wose hamwenga, mwa awo wandima wa Daudi nawahungukilwa ni watowani mlongo na kenda hamwenga na Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Mna watowani wa Daudi wawakomaga want'hu magana matatu na mtandatu wa Benjamini, awo wandaga na Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Woho nawo niyo wenula kimba cha Asaheli, wakammosela msanga hagihi na kikuta cha ise uko Betelehemu. Yoabu na want'hu wakwe niyo waita ikiya ikilo, niyo kwawacheela uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Nokunda na nk'hondo ya lupisi lutali mwa want'hu wawazumile Sauli, na wadya wamzumile Daudi. Mna Daudi ongezekelaga ludole, na want'hu wa Sauli wagendeelaga kusokela.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana kilume wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Wana kilume welekagwa na Daudi uko Hebuloni wandaga ni Amoni nt'hula sasu ywakwe, nine andaga Ahinoamu kulawa Yezileeli, <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Kileabu mwanawe ywa kaidi, nine andaga Abigaili afiilwe ni mgosi uyo Nabali kulawa Kalimeli, Abisalomu mwanawe ywa katatu, nine andaga Maaka mwanawe ywe kike Talimai, seuta ywa Geshuli. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Adoniya mwanawe ywa kane, nine andaga ni Hagiti, Shefatia mwanawe ywa shano, nine andaga ni Abitali, <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />na Iteleamu mwanawe ywa mtandatu, nine andaga Egila, mkaziwe Daudi. Wakaziwe Daudi nawamwelekela wana awo wose akanda uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abimeli akelunga na Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Mwo kugendeela ink'hondo watowani wa Daudi na wa Sauli, Abineli nakatendesa kunda na ludole mwa watowani wa Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli nakanda na muwele yumwenga etangwagwa Lisipa, mwana Aya, lupisi lumwenga, Ishibosheti niyo amuuza Abineli, “Nii ukagona na muwele ywa Tate?” <verse eid="2SA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineli nakanda na maya vitendese kwajili yo ulosi wa Ishiboleti, akagamba, “Togola, wagamba miye nadaha kumhituka Sauli? Togola kumanya kugamba miye ni mhuwilwa mwe mp'huga ya Yuda? Kaula, miye hinda mnt'hu ywedi kwa iso Sauli na wanduguze na wambwiyaze naho hikuikile mwo udahi wa Daudi mpaka dyelo. Mna, dyelo ivi waniona kunda na masa kwa ajili ya mvele uyu. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Mnungu anikome uneva hinadamanye yose Mnungu amlagane Daudi.” <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Mnungu nakamsigiila Daudi kugamba nausamize useuta kulawa mwe mp'huga ya Sauli na kumwinka yehe. Naye nawalongoze Izilaeli na Yuda kulawa Dani mpaka Beelisheba. <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishibosheti hakadaha kulonga ulosi, kwaviya nakanda akamuogoha Abineli.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ivo, Abineli niyo awatuma want'hu kwa Daudi, uko Hebuloni wakamgambile, “Togola, isi ino ni ani nailongoze? Damanya Ndagano na miye, na miye nohwambize Izilaeli yose inde yako.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi niyo agamba, “Vedi, nenidamanye Ndagano na weye, mna nina mbuli imwenga kulawa kwako, nayo ni ino, usekwiza kwangu mpaka unigaile Mikali mwana kike wa Sauli, niho noudahe kwiza kwangu.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Ivo Daudi niyo atuma want'hu kwa Ishibosheti, mwana wa Sauli, akagamba nivuzile mkazangu Mikali, uyo namlombaga kwa machupu gana ya Wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ivo Ishibosheti kasigiila want'hu wakamguhe Mikali kulawa kwa mgosiwe Pateli, mwana Laishi. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Uyo mgosiwe niyo atongelana nae, akagendela kuwila, akamtimila mpaka Bahulimu. Niho Abineli akamgamba, “Heye, uya.” Naye niyo auya.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abineli agendaga kusimuila na wadala wa Izilaeli, akawagamba, “Kwa lupisi lwomboke mnda mkamuunga Daudi ande seuta ywenyu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Haluse, leteni mbuli iyo mwe kiyeti kwaviya Zumbe nakamsigiila ivi Daudi, ‘Nohwink'he udahi mndima ywangu, uwakombole want'hu wangu wa Izilaeli kulawa mwa Wafilisiti na kulawa mwa wank'hondo wako watuhu.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Abineli niyo asimwiila na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini, no kuita mpaka Hebuloni niyo wamgambila Daudi yadya want'hu wose wa Izilaeli na kabila dyose dya Benjamini ivo waivane wadamanye.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abineli eze amwitile Daudi akanda na want'hu milongo miidi, Daudi nawa sank'hanilaga ludyo. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abineli niyo amgambila Daudi, “Miye haluse neniite na kukuletela want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, weye Zumbe ywangu. Naweze wadamanya Ndagano na weye, vileke unde Zumbe ywawe, na weye nouwalongoze wose enga ivo ukuunga.” Daudi niyo amlaga Abineli akeitile naye niyo aita kwa utondowazi.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli akomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Akajika aho wandima wa Daudi hamwenga na Yoabu nawauya kulawa kwo kutoana naho wauyaga na vitahigwe vibindile wingi. Mna Abineli handile hamwenga na Daudi uko Hebuloni kwaviya Daudi nakamleka akeitile, naye niyo aita kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu eze auye hamwenga na watowani wakwe wose endile nao, nakagambilwa kugamba Abineli mwana Neli, ezaga kumsinya seuta Daudi, yehe naye niyo amlaga akeitile, naye niyo aita kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="2SA 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Yoabu nakamwitila seuta na kumgambila, “Haluse kudamanya mbwai? Kaula Abineli nekeza kwako, ni mbwai kumleka aite? <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Togola, kumanya kugamba Abineli mwana wa Neli keza kukudantiliza? Keza kupelemba amanye ludole na lugendo lwako na yadya ukudamanya!”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu eze alawe kusimwiila na Daudi, nakawatuma want'hu wamlete Abineli, na woho niyo wabwiila mwe disima dya Sila. Mna Daudi hamanyize mbuli iyo. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abineli eze auye kulawa Hebuloni, Yoabu amguhaga niyo amwingiza kwe chumba kugamba enga aunga kusimwiila naye kwa kinyele. Aho Yoabu niyo amtunga Abineli mwe zinda kwaviya Abineli nakanda kamkoma Asaheli nduguye, naye niyo abanika. <verse eid="2SA 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Kubula aho Daudi eze eve mbuli izo niyo agamba, “Miye na useuta wangu hekinde na masa ha Zumbe Mnungu mwe file ya Abineli mwana Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Masa ayo ya ukomi nayande ya Yoabu na mp'huga yose ya Ise! Mp'huga ya Yoabu mazuwa yose nokunde na mnt'hu mta unyonge wa kisonono, hegu unyonge wa matana, hegu kugenda kwa makome hegu kukomigwa kwa sime, hegu mta gumbo!” <verse eid="2SA 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu na nduguye Abishai nawamkoma Abineli kwaviya nawamkoma nduguye Asaheli lupisi lwa nk'hondo uko Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli amoselwa msanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Niho, seuta Daudi amgamba Yoabu na wadya wose wendile hamwenga naye, tatuleni zisuke zenyu naho mvale magunia vileke mumhongezele Abineli. mwo lupisi lwa kummosela msanga, seuta Daudi nakagendela kunyuma ye dijeneza. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Abineli nakamoswa msanga uko Hebuloni na seuta naye nakahongeza kwa izwi akanda hagihi ye dijeneza, naho want'hu watuhu wailaga. <verse eid="2SA 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Seuta niyo amhongeza Abineli akagamba, “Neinda vivihi Abineli abanike enga mhezi?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Mikono yako haikakilizwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Viga vako havigeligwe mnyololo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">Kabanika enga mnt'hu akomigwe na waihi!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2SA 3:34">Want'hu wose niyo wamwiila naho.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Niyo, want'hu wose wagenda kudindiliza Daudi adye nk'hande kukei mtondo. Mna Daudi nakaika kilapi, akawagamba, “Mnungu naanikome uneva nenidye mkate hegu kint'hu chochose mpaka kisingi!” <verse eid="2SA 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Want'hu waone mbuli izo, woho nawo welelwa, kwa kila kint'hu kidamanywe ni seuta ivo kiwawagile. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ivo, zuwa diya, Waizilaeli wose nawamanya kugamba hayendile ivo seuta Daudi kumkoma Abineli mwana wa Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Seuta Daudi nakawagambila wandima wakwe, “Togoleni, hammanyize kugamba kilongozi mkulu kabanika mwe Izilaeli? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Hamwenga na kugamba mnikumba mavuta vileke ninde seuta, mna dyelo miye hina ludole. Awa wana wa Seluya ni wakomi vitendese. Zumbe Mnungu awasulumize want'hu awa vikuligana no uwihi wawe!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishibosheti kakomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishibosheti mwana Sauli eze eve kugamba Abineli kakomigwa uko Hebuloni, engilaga chevu hamwenga na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishibosheti mwana ywa Sauli, nakanda na want'hu waidi wendile vilongozi wa mwe vifyo va kutowa, yumwenga etangwagwa Baana, mtuhu naye ni Lekabu. Awo nawanda wana wa Limoni, mnt'hu wa kabila dya Benjamini kulawa mwo mzi wa Beeloti, ivo Beeloti nounda mzi wa kabila dya Benjamini, <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />kwaviya wakaya wa Beeloti nawanyilikila Gitaimu, naho wagendeela kwikala uko mpaka dyelo.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yonasani mwana ywa Sauli andaga na mwana aholomp'hale iviga etangwagwa Mefibosheti. Umwo umwana uyo andaga na miyaka mishano Sauli na Yonasani wakomagwa uko kwe nk'hondo. Umwo mbuli izi ze file ya Yonasani na Sauli zize zivike kulawa Yezilaeli, malela ywa Meshibosheti amwinulaga umwana uyo na kuguluka naye mna umwo andile akagulukisa agwaga niyo iviga vo mwana uyo vavunika.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Lekabu na Baana wana Limoni Mbeeloti niyo waita kwe kaya ya Ishibosheti. Nawabula nomsi uko, Ishibosheti akanda kahumula kwe kaya yakwe. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6" />Niyo wengila kwe kaya, enga waunga waguhe ngano, wambwiilaga Ishibosheti kagona mwo lusazi mndani mwe chumba chakwe, wamjungaga mjungo mwe zinda na kumkoma. <verse eid="2SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:7" />Wamk'hanta mtwi wakwe na kuita nawo, wombokelaga sila ya Alaba, wakagenda kilo na msi. <verse eid="2SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Niyo wamwigaila Daudi umtwi wa Ishibosheti uko Hebuloni, wakamgamba, “Seuta, kaula uno nu mtwi wa Ishibosheti, mwana Sauli mnk'hondo ywako, auzungulaga wikazi wako. Dielo ino Zumbe Mnungu kakulihizila, kwa Sauli na welekwa wakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Mna Daudi niyo amhitula Lekabu na Baana nduguye, wana wa Limoni Mbeeloti, “Nakelisa kwa Zumbe mta udahi, yehe kanamila wikazi wangu kulawa mwe kila mnk'hondo! <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />Yudya mnt'hu ezile kunigambila kugamba Sauli kabanika, akafanyanya kugamba anigaila mbuli yedi, nehimgwila na kumkoma uko Sigilaga. Idyo nidyo digeleko nimwink'hile kwo ulosi uwo anigaile. <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Togola, mnt'hu mwiihi anamkoma mnt'hu heena masa akanda mwo lusazi kwe kaya yakwe, togola hiyo vedi kulihiza kwajili ya kumkomela hale?” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Daudi awalagizaga watowani wakwe, nawo niyo wawakoma Lekabu na Baana. Na kuwakant'ha mikono yawe ne iviga vawe. niyo waihweleza mwe miti mnk'handa mwe dikawa uko Hebuloni. Mna nawaguha mtwi wa Ishibosheti na kuumosela msanga mwe kikuta cha Abineli uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi anda seuta ywa Izilaeli na Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Niyo makabila yose ya Izilaeli yaita kwa Daudi uko Hebuloni niyo wamgamba, “Kaula, suwe ki welekwa wako. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Aho kale, Sauli eze ande seuta ywetu ni weye wawalongozaga Waizilaeli kwe nk'hondo, Mnungu naye akugambila kugamba nounde mdimi ywa want'hu wakwe awo Waizilaeli naho nounde kilongozi mkulu mwe Izilaeli.” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ivo, wadala wose wa Izilaeli wamwitila seuta Daudi uko Hebuloni, naye niyo adamanya Ndagano naye ha Mnungu, naho wamkumba Daudi mavuta ande seuta ywa Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi nakanda na miyaka milongo mitatu akalongoza kwa lupisi lwa miyaka milongo mine. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Uko Hebuloni, nakawalongoza want'hu wa Yuda kwa miyaka mfungate na miezi mtandatu, na Yelusalemu nako nakawalongoza want'hu wa Izilaeli hamwenga na Yuda kwa miyaka milongo mitatu na nt'hatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi anda mhumi uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Niyo seuta na watowani wakwe nawaita Yelusalemu wakatowane na Wayebusi wandile wakaya wa Isi iyo. Mna woho wamgambaga,“ Howingile mwo mzi uno, kwaviya mant'hunt'hu na waholomp'hale nawakugulusile hale.” Nawamgambila ivo kwaviya nawakafanyanya kugamba Daudi haadahe kwingila mwo mzi uwo. <verse eid="2SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Hata ivo, seuta Daudi atahaga ink'hambi ya Sayuni, uwo nuwo mzi wa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Zuwa idyo, Daudi agambaga, Mnt'hu yeyose naawatoe Wayebusi naombokele mwo mwina wa mazi vileke kuwatowa waholomp'hale na mant'hunt'hu awo moyo wangu ukuwaihiya. Nivo vikuleka want'hu wagamba, “Mant'hunt'hu na waholomp'hale hawengile mwe kaya.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi nekekala mwe nkambi iyo, mzi uwo nao niyo awitanga, “Mzi wa Daudi.” Daudi nakauzenga mzi kuuzunguluka, akakongela Milo kuhinga kundani. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Naye Daudi nakatendesa kunda mdahi, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu nakamtenda ande mdahi.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Mna seuta Hilamu wa Tilo nakawasigila want'hu kwa Daudi, nakamwiigaila mielezi, wakusongola na wazesi awo wamzengelega Daudi inyumba ink'hulu. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ivo, Daudi niyo atambula kugamba Zumbe Mnungu kamtenda ande seuta ywakwe kwaajili ya want'hu wa Izilaeli niyo aukuza useuta wakwe kwajili ya want'hu wakwe Izilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Daudi akeguhilaga wawele na wandima na wavele wengi wa uko kwe mzi wa Yelusalemu, ivo ajike kulawa Hebuloni. awo wamwelekela wana wengi wa kilume na wa kike. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Yakutimila ni mazina ya wana wa kilume na wakaziwe wamwelekele uko Yelusalemu. Shamua na Shobabu na Nasani na Selemani, <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />Ibahali na Elishua na Nefegi na Yafia, <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />Elishama na Eliyada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwahuma Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Wafilisiti weze weve kugamba Daudi kakumbigwa mavuta kunda seuta ywa Izilaeli, wose wafosaga kugenda kumzungula, mna yehe evaga imbuli iyo, niyo engila mndani mwe digomela. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Wafilisiti nawabula na kusambala mwe dikolongo dya Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Ivo, Daudi nakamuuza Zumbe Mnungu, “Togola niite hatowane na Wafilisiti? togola, nounink'he udahi wa kuwa huma?” Zumbe Mnungu naye niyo amgamba Daudi, “Ita, kwaviya nna kindedi kugamba nohwink'he udahi wa kuwahuma Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Ivo, Daudi niyo abula Baali Pelasimu, na kuwahuma Wafilisiti niyo agamba, “Zumbe Mnungu mwa wank'hondo wangu nakanda enga mazi ya lawo.” Kwaivo hant'hu aho niyo hetangwa Baali pelasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Woho nawo niyo waleka milungu yawe uko, Daudi na want'hu wakwe waiduulaga hale.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Naho wakwelaga naho Wafilisiti na mpaka naho na kusambala mwe dikolongo dya Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi eze amlombeze Mnungu, Mnungu niyo kamgamba, “Usekuwatoa kulaila aho wili, mna zunguluka na uwatoe kulongole ye miti ya mifolosadi. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Naho mneva zisindo mnanga mwe mifolosadi, aho mkeink'he ludole kwaviya neninde hifosa vileke hulongoele niwatowe watowani we Kifilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi nakadamanya enga ivo Mnungu amsigile, naye niyo awatoa Wafilisiti kulawa Geba mpaka Gezeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku dye Ndagano dyegalwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Daudi nakawaduganya naho watowani wakwe wadahi wa Izilaeli, uwazilo wawe nawanda alufu milongo mitatu. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Yehe hamwenga na watowani wadahi waitaga ukwo Baale ya Yuda vileke wakadiguhe Disanduku dya Mnungu dikwitangwa kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, uyo akwikala mwe ngubiko ye Disanduku dye Ndagano hagatigati ye viumbwa vina mawawa vikwitangwa makelubi. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Niyo wadiguha Disanduku kulawa mwe nyumba ya Abinadabu iyo yandaga kwo mnima wadikweze mwe mnanga mwe digali idihya dikugendezwa ni zing'ombe. Uza na Ahio wana Abinadabu nawo wandaga wakadilongoza digali idyo, <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />dyandaga ne Disanduku dya Mnungu, Ahiyo naye akanda kulongole kwe disanduku idyo. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, wandaga wakakema wila na kuvina kwa udahi wawe wose, ha Zumbe Mnungu. Watowaga mazeze na vinanda na vinubi na lupatu na ngoma. <verse eid="2SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Weze wabule mwo lwazo lwo kuhutila ulozo kwa nakoni, Uza nakachulula mkono wakwe na kuditoza Disanduku dya Zumbe Mnungu kwaviya ziya zing'ombe nezikobadika. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Aho, Mnungu niyo amuonela maya Uza. Mnungu kamkoma ahadya. Uza niyo abanika ahadya Mnk'handa mwe diya Disanduku dya Mnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Naye Daudi niyo engila maya kwaviya Mnungu kamsulumiza Uza kwa maya. Ivo hant'hu aho niyo hetangwa Pelesi Uza mpaka ivi dyelo. <verse eid="2SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Daudi niyo amogoha Mnungu zuwa diya akagamba, “Nedize vivihi kwangu Disanduku dya Zumbe Mnungu?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Ivo Daudi haungile kudileta sanduku dya Zumbe kwo mzi wa Daudi, mna Daudi niyo adisamizila mwe nyumba ya Obedi wa Edomu ywe dikabila dya giti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Sanduku dya Zumbe Mnungu nakadiika mwe nyumba ya Obedi Edomu ywe dikabila dya giti, lupisi lwa miezi mitatu, naye Zumbe Mnungu niyo amvikila Obedi Edomu, ne mp'huga yakwe yose.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Akajika aho want'hu nawamgambila Daudi, kugamba Zumbe kamvikile Obedi edomu kila kint'hu ne mp'huga yakwe kwaviya yehe niye nakaamila Disanduku dye Ndagano, Daudi eze eve ivo yehe na want'hu watuhu waitaga kwa Obedi Edomu, na kudidiguha Disanduku kulawa kwa Obedi Edomu kuita Yelusalemu wakanga kwa kinyemi. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Want'hu wadya wadiinule sanduku dya Zumbe Mnungu kila aho wakagenda nk'hach mtandatu Daudi nakawagamba wakimale amlavile Zumbe Mnungu nt'hambiko ya jeku digimbale. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi akanda kakefunga kazibau kwo ulavant'hambiko mwe kigudi chakwe nakavina kwa udahi wakwe wose ha Mnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Ivo, yehe na waizilaeli wose nawadiigala Disanduku mpaka kwo mzi wa Daudi kwa kinyemi na izwi kulu dya magunda. <verse eid="2SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Sanduku dya Mnungu umwo dyandaga dikekingila mwo mzi wa Daudi, Mikali mwana kike wa Sauli nakasungila mwe dilisha niyo amuona seuta Daudi akapilika na kuvina ha Mnungu, ivo niyo ambela mwo moyo wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Mna wadiingiza sanduku dya Mnungu mndani mwe dihema idyo adikimaga Daudi niyo wadiika disanduku hant'hu hakwe. Daudi naye niyo alava nt'hambiko za kokigwa na nt'hambiko za utondowazi ha Mnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Daudi eze ibinde kulava nt'hambiko zo kokigwa na za utondowazi, nakawavikila want'hu kwa zina dya Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />na kuwapangila want'hu wose, we difyo dya Izilaeli, wagosi na wavele, kila yumwenga, mkate, na kihendo cha nyama na mkate wa zabibu. wakajika aho, want'hu wose nawahalawa, kila mnt'hu nakauya kwe kaya yakwe. <verse eid="2SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Daudi eze auye kwe kaya yakwe vileke avikile imp'huga yakwe, Mikali mwana kike ywa Sauli, agendaga kumsingila, niyo agamba, “Hihungila seuta ywa Izilaeli kuketunya dyelo kwa kunda kimbwigili ha wandima wakwe wa kivele enga mnt'hu abwalate ivo akuhambula zisuke zakwe haheina soni ha want'hu!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi niyo amgamba Mikali, “Nehinda ha meso ha Mnungu yudya anisagulaga miye hant'hu ha iso, ne mp'huga yakwe, vileke ninde mkulu mwa Izilaeli, awo want'hu wakwe Mnungu, kwaivo miye nenivine du ha Mnungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Miye nenikeseleze mwenye kujink'ha ivi haluse. Weye nounione hiyo kint'hu, mna awo wandima wa kivele uwalongile nawanitunye!”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Ivo Mikali mwana kike ywa Sauli havadahikaga kupata na mwana mpaka mwo kubanika kwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Nasani kwa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Umwo seuta Daudi akanda akekala mwe nyumba yakwe yo useuta, Mnungu naye nakamwink'ha udahi kunda na utondowazi na wank'hondo wakwe kila hant'hu, <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Seuta Daudi niyo amgamba Muwona Nasani, “Miye nekala mwe nyumba izengigwe kwa maziti ya mibani, mna Sanduku dya Mnungu dyekala mwe dihema!”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Nasani niyo amgamba seuta, “Ita ukadamanye chochose kiya ukufanyanya mwo moyo wako, kwaviya Mnungu ehamwenga na weye.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Mna kilo ikiya niyo Mnungu amgmbaga Nasani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Ita ukamgambe mndima ywangu Daudi, kugamba, ‘Togola, ni weye nounizengele nyumba ya kwikala? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kukongela zuwa dia niwalavile Waizilaeli mwe Isi ya Misili mpaka ivi dyelo hiikale mwe nyumba. Higenda kila hant'hu handa nekala mwe dihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Togola, kila hant'hu aho nigendile na Waizilaeli wose nehimuuza kilongozi yeyose ywa Izilaeli yudya nimsigiile kugamba awadime want'hu wa Izilaeli, nii hunizengele nyumba ya miti ya mibani.’<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Kwa ivo, mgambe mndima ywangu Daudi. Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi agamba, ‘Nehikulava uko noukadima zingoto vileke unde kilongozi ywa want'hu wangu Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kukongela lupisi ulo nehinda hamwenga na weye kokose uko uitile nehiwakoma wank'hondo wako wose hako. Nohutende kunda mkulu enga wakulu watuhu mwe isi. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Name neniwasaguile want'hu wangu wa Izilaeli hant'hu ho kwikala, vileke wekale hant'hu hawo kwa utondowazi. Na awo want'hu waihile wakutimila udahi wawe hawadahe naho enga aho nk'hongo, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />nakulagana kukudima na wank'hondo wako naho nohwink'he welekwa. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Naho ukeza kubanika na kuumoselwa msanga hamwenga wakale wako nenimtende yumwenga mwa wanao we kilume kunda seuta naho useuta wakwe unde na ludole. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Yehe niye naazenge miye nyumba naho neniutende useuta wakwe unde wa mazuwa yose. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Miye neninde ise, naye naande mwanangu. Akadamanya yaihile, nenimvuze enga ivo want'hu wakuvuza mwanawe kwa ngoda. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Mna heniwausile uwedi wangu enga viya niusile kwa Sauli, nimhause hako. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Mp'huga yako na useuta wako nevikale mazuwa yose. Ukulu wako nounde na ludole mazuwa yose.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nasani nakamgambila Daudi kila kint'hu alagiswe mwe uwona uwo wa Mnungu.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi alombeza uvikilwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Seuta Daudi engilaga mndani no kwikala ha Mnungu, no kulombeza akagamba, “Miye ne mp'huga yangu hakina uwagilwe wey ukibuze aha nili diyelo! <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Naho mbuli ino neinda ndodo hako, Zumbe Mnungu, hamwenga na ayo kuwaikila mp'huga yangu mbuli nk'hulu mwe miaka mingi ikwiza, naho kunitenda niyaone ayo. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Miye name Daudi hugambilei naho? Kwaviya weye kummanya mndima ywako. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Viligane na kiya ulongile, naho viligane na viya ukuunga, kudamanya makulu ayo yose, vileke unihinize miye mndima ywako. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu niweye mkulu, kwaviya hakuli enga weye, naho hahali Mnungu mtuhu mna ni weye, kwaivo kivile suwe wenye. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Naho ni ani akwinga want'hu wako Izilaeli, Isi imwenga mwe si iyo Mnungu afosaga kugenda kuikombola kunda want'hu wakwe mwenye. Akedamanyilaga zina dyakwe na kudamanya vihungi vikulu na kweheela kwa kuwagulusa want'hu wa isi na milungu yawe kulongole kwa want'hu wako, awo uwakombole kulawa Misili. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Nawe kuwatenda want'hu wako Izilaeli watoge naho wande want'hu wako mazuwa yose, nawe Zumbe Mnungu kunda Mnungu ywawe.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Haluse elo, Zumbe Mnungu yadya ulongile mwe mbuli ya mndima ywako, na mwe mbuli ya welekwa wangu yangu, uitende itoge mazuwa yose, udamanye enga ivo ulongile, <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />vileke zina dyako ditunywe kwa kugamba, ‘Zumbe mta udahi niye Mnungu ywa Waizilaeli. Naho nyumba ya mndima ywako, Daudi, neinde itogile hako.’ <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Weye Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, Mnungu ywa Izilaeli, kunitenda miye mndima ywako nimanye kagamba nohuzengele nyumba. Nivo vikuleka miye mndima ywako, hikeiva vedi mwo moyo nilombeza mbuli ino kwako.<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Ivo haluse, Zumbe Mnungu, weye ni weye Mnungu, na ulosi wako ni kindedi, weye nawe kumwikila mndima ywako mbuli ino iyedi, <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />ivo, haluse nakulombeza uzumile kuivikila inyumba ya mndima ywako, ipate kwikalisa mazuwa yose hako, kwaviya weye Zumbe Mnungu kulonga kugamba kwa uvikilwa wako nyumba ya mndima ywako neivikilwe mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Daudi ahuma nk'hondo nyingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Akajika, Daudi awatowaga na kuwahuma Wafilisiti niyo autaha mzi wa Metegi ama kulawa mwo udahi wa Wafilisiti.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Naho Daudi awahumaga Wamoabu. Awaikaga mwe misafa miidi na kuwahima kwa utali wa sigi awo watahigwa, mafyo ayo nayakomwa, naho eze ahime nk'hanana ya katatu, fyo idyo nakadileka kunda gima. Ivo Wamoabu wandaga mwo udahi wa Daudi woho nawo wamwigailaga Daudi kodi. <verse eid="2SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Akajika Daudi atowanaga na Hadadezeli mwana ywa Lehobu, seuta ywa Soba, umwo agendaga kuvuza udahi wakwe hant'hu aho ho mto Efulate. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi nakataha magali ya nk'hondo elufu imwenga, na wagendeza magali alufu mfungate, na watowani wakugenda lwa viga alufu milongo miidi. Daudi nakakant'ha zinyuge ze viga kunyuma ye zifalasi zose za magali. Asigazaga du falasi gana. <verse eid="2SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Na awo Wasilia wa Damasko weze waite wakamwambize Hadadezeli seuta ywa Soba, Daudi nakawatowa na kuwakoma want'hu alufu milongo miidi na waidi. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Niyo Daudi aika nkambi ya watowani mwo mzi wa Wasilia wa Damesiki. Ivo, Wasilia niyo wenda wandima wakwe wakamliha kodi. Mnungu kamwink'ha Daudi uhumi kokose uko aitile. <verse eid="2SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Daudi nakaziguha nk'hindo za zahabu izo zandaga za wank'hondo wa Hadadezeli no kuziigala Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Naho nakaguha shaba nyingi kulawa mwo mzi wa Beta na Belotia, indile mizi ya hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Mwo lupisi lwa seuta Toi ywa Hamati, eze eve kugamba Daudi kawahuma wank'hondo wose wa Hadadezeli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />Nakamtuma mwanawe Yolamu kwa seuta Daudi kumwigaila ndamsa na kumtunya kwaviya nakatoana na Hadadezeli na kumhuma. Kwaviya Hadadezeli nakatoana na Toi nk'hanana nyingi, Yolamu nakamwigaila Daudi geleko dya vyombo va masawa na zahabu na shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Geleko idyo, hamwenga na matundu na zahabu izo azitahile kwe ziisi zose izo azihumile, nakamlava Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />vint'hu ivo ni kulawa Edomu, na Moabu na Amoni na Filisitia na Amaleki hamwenga na izo atahile kwa seuta Hadadezeli, mwana wa Lehobu seuta wa Soba. <verse eid="2SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Daudi nakakeongezela kumanyikisa. Akanda akauya mwo kwajika kumhuma Hadadezeli, nakawakoma Waedomu alufu mlongo na mnane, mwe dikolongo dya munyu. <verse eid="2SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Kaika nkambi za watowani mwe Edomu yose. Na awo Waedomu wose wa uko niyo wenda wandima wakwe. Zumbe Mnungu nakamwink'ha uhumi Daudi kokose kudya aitile. <verse eid="2SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Ivo, Daudi niyo ailongoza Izilaeli yose, akawatendela uwagilwa want'hu wakwe wose haheina kwazagula. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu mwana ywa Seluya, nakanda mkulu wa wank'hondo. Yehoshafati mwana wa Ahiludi, nakanda aika nk'humbukila kwa yose nayakalaila. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki mwana ywa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki mwana ywa Abiatali nawanda walavant'hambiko, Seluya nakanda mwandisi mkulu. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya mwana ywa Yehoyada nakanda kilongozi ywa Wakileti na Wapeleti nawo wana wa Daudi niyo wanda vilongozi wakulu.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Zuwa dimwenga, Daudi auzaga, “Togola, kuna mt'hu yeyose asigale mwe mp'huga ya Sauli? Naunga nimdamanyile uwedi kwajili ya Yonasani.” <verse eid="2SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kwandaga na mndima mwe mp'huga ya Sauli etangwagwa Siba. Siba etangwagwa aite kwa Daudi. Seuta Daudi niyo amuuza, “Togola weye ni weye Siba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Naye niyo amhitula, “Heye, ni miye mndima ywako.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Seuta niyo amuuza, “Togola eyaho mnt'hu yeyose asigale mwe mp'huga ya Sauli? Uneva eyaho naunga nimdamanyile uwedi wa Mnungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba niyo amhitula, “Eyaho mwana Yonasani, mna yehe kaholomp'hala iviga.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Seuta niyo amuuza naho, “Ekuhi uyo?” Siba niyo amhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">“Eyuko kaya kwa Makili mwana Ahimieli uko Lo Debali.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ivo, seuta Daudi niyo asigiila want'hu, niyo wakamlete kulawa kwe kaya ya Makili mwana Ahimieli uko Lo Debali.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ivo, Mefibosheti mwana Yonasani naho mwezukuluwe dya Sauli aitaga kwa seuta Daudi, na kufunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi aho ha seuta Daudikwa kumtunya. Daudi niyo amwitanga, “Mefibosheti.” Naye niyo etika, “Woe.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Usekogoha miye nohutendele uwedi kwaajili ya iso Yonasani. Idya isanga yose yandile ya babaako Sauli nohuvuzile. Weye nawe noudye holudyo lwangu mazuwa yose.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefibosheti niyo afunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi, na kugamba, “Miye mndima ywako hi kint'hu, nii unidamanyile ayo?”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Niyo, seuta Daudi amwitanga Siba mndima ywa Sauli, akamgamba, “Udya ugoli wose wandile wa Sauli na mp'huga yakwe himwink'ha mwezukuluwe ywa seuta ywako. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Weye na wanawo na wandima wako. nomumlimile Mefibosheti naho nommwigaile ulozo vileke mwezukuluwe ywa seuta ywako ande na nk'hande mazuwa yose. Mna yehe naye nekindanye ho ludyo mazuwa yose.” Mwo lupisi ulwo, Siba andaga na wana kilume mlongo na washano na wandima milongo miidi.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Niyo, Siba amgamba seuta, “Miye mndima ywako nenidamanye viligane na ivo seuta ywangu aungile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:11">Ivo, Mefibosheti andaga ho ludyo hamwenga na seuta, andaga enga mwana seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Mefibosheti andaga na mwana mdodo ywa kilume etangwagwa Mika. Want'hu wose we mp'huga ya Siba niyo wanda wandima wa Mefibosheti. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Naho Mefibosheti uyo andaga kaholomp'hala iviga vakwe vose ekalaga Yelusalemu. Mazuwa yose nawandanya na seuta aho ho ludyo.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi awahuma Waamoni na Waashulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Mwo kwajika ayo seuta Nahashi Waamoli abanikaga, ivo mwanawe etangwagwa Hanuni niyo anda seuta hant'hu haise. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Seuta Daudi niyo agamba, “Nenimtendele uwedi Hanuni mwana Nahashi enga ivo ise anitendile.” Ivo Daudi niyo asigiila want'hu wakamhani. Nawo wegala ulosi wa Daudi weze wabule mwe isi ya Waamoli, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />wakulu wa Wamoli wamuuzaga seta ywawe Hanuni, “Togola, wafanyanya kugamba Daudi kwa kuwatuma awo want'hu vileke wakuhani kamtunya iso? Togola, Daudi hawatumile want'hu awa kwako wakaule na kuipelemba isi yako vileke waitahe?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Ivo, Hanuni awagwilaga wegala ulosi awo wa Daudi na kummoga nt'hendelo imwenga ye kilevula chakwe, na kuyatatula mavalo yawe mpaka kwe zink'hailo, niyo awaleka wakeitile. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Daudi eze agambilwe mbuli iyo atumaga want'hu wakawasingile kwaviya waonaga soni vitendese. Ivo seuta niyo awagamba, “Ikaleni mwo mzi wa Yeliko, mpaka aho nezihote zindevu zenyu, niho nomuuye kaya.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Waamoni weze wamanye kugamba wanda wank'hondo wa Daudi, wawaguhaga watowani wa Wasilia alufu milongo miidi wakugenda, kulawa Bete Helobu na Soba, na watowani alufu mlongo na waidi kulawa Tobu na seuta Maaka akanda na watowani alufu imwenga. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Daudi naye eze eve mbuli izo, amtumaga Yoabu aite na watowani wose wadahi. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Waamoni wafosaga na kukepanga watowane nk'hondo mwe nk'hili zo mzi wa Laba, mzi wawe mkulu, Wasilia nao kulawa Soba na Lehobu na want'hu kulawa Toba na Maaka wakepangaga mwe nyika.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu naye eze aone nk'hondo imzunguluka, kulongole na kunyuma, awasagulaga watowani wadahi wa Izilaeli na kuwapanga watowane na Wasilia. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Wadya watowani wasigale awaikaga mwo ukimalizi wa nduguye Abishai, naye niyo awapanga watowane na Waamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu amgambaga Abishai, “Uneva Wasilia wananihuma ludole nounambibize naho uneva Waamoni wanakuhuma, nenize hwambize. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Mna utoge! Kitowane kigosi kwaajili ya want'hu wetu na kwaajili ye mizi ya Mnungu ywetu, naye Zumbe Mnungu naakitendele yadya yakumwelela!”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Ivo, Yoabu na want'hu wakwe wagendaga kutowana na Waamoni, Wasilia niyo wanyilika. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Waamoni weze waone kugamba Wasilia wanyilika, woho nawo wamnyilikaga Abishai na kwingila mwo mzi. Yoabu niyo aleka kutowana na Waamoni, niyo auya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Mna Wasilia weze waone kugamba wahumigwa na Waizilaeli, wakeduganyaga hamwenga. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Hadadezeli alagizaga Wasilia wandile kwe nt'hendelo ya kaidi yo mto Efulate wegalwe uko Helamu wakalongozwa ni Shobaki mtowani mkulu ywe difyo dya Hadadezeli. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi eze eve, awaduganyaga hamwenga Waizilaeli wose, niyo wadendeluka mto Yolodani na kuita mpaka Helamu. Wasilia nawo wakepangaga wakatowane nk'hondo na Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Mna Wasilia wanyilikaga ha Waizilaeli. Daudi awakomaga Wasilia magana mfungate wandaga wakagendeza magali ya nk'hondo, wakugendeza zifalasi alufu milongo mine, Naho amlumizaga Shobaki mkulu ywa watowani wawe, niyo abanika aaho. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Niyo maseuta wose wandaga wandima wa Hadadezeli weze waone kugamba wahumigwa ni Waizilaeli, wadamanyaga mwivano na Waizilaeli, woho nawo niyo wanda wandima wa Izilaeli, Ivo Wasilia hawagezaga naho kuwaambiza Waamoni.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Betisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Mwe nk'hongelo yo mwaka mhya, umwo maseuta wakaita kwe nk'hondo, Daudi amtumaga Yoabu na wakulu wa watowani akanda hamwenga ne difyo dyose dya Waizilaeli. Nawawakoma pele Waamoni na kuuzunguluka mzi wa Laba. Mna Daudi asigalaga Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Zuwa dimwenga kisingi, Daudi enukaga mwo lusazi niyo aita hant'hu ho kuhumuila uko kulanga mwe nyumba ya kiseuta. Umwo andile akagenda genda uko kulanga, aonaga mvele yumwenga ahombweele andaga akahaka mazi. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Daudi asigilaga mnt'hu kuuza mvele uyo ni ani. Uyo asigiilwe niyo amgamba mvele uyo ni Betisheba mwana Eliyabu, naho ni mkaza Ulia kulawa mwe dikabila dya Mhiti. <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Ivo, Daudi niyo asigiila want'hu wamwigale uyo mvele. Betisheba ezaga kwa Daudi, Daudi niyo agenda naye, naho mwo lupisi ulwo mvele uyo niho akukaga kulawa mwa mazuwa yakwe, niyo auya kwakwe. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Uyo mvele niyo enula ubovu, naye niyo asigiila mnt'hu kwa Daudi kugamba yehe kapata ubovu.<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ivo, Daudi niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Nigaile Ulia we dikabila dya Mhiti kwangu.” Yoabu naye niyo amwigala Ulia kwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Ulia eze abule kwakwe, Daudi amuuzaga mbuli za Yoabu, na watowani na ivo nk'hondo ikugendeela. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Niyo Daudi amgamba Ulia, “Uya kwe kaya yako ukahumule hadodo.” Ulia niyo ahalawa mwe kaya ya seuta, naho niyo seuta amwigaila mageleko. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Mna Ulia hauyaga kwe kaya yakwe, ivo agonaga hamwenga na wamizi wose wa seuta he nk'hili ye nyumba ya kiseuta. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Daudi eze agambilwe kugamba haitaga kwe kaya yakwe, Daudi amuuzaga Ulia, “Weye kulawa nt'hambo, nii hwiitile kwe kaya yako?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ulia amhitulaga Daudi, “Sanduku dye Ndagano hamwenga na watowani wose wa Izilaeli na Yuda wekala mwe viheha kwe nk'hondo. Mkulu ywangu Yoabu na vilongozi wakulu wose watoaga nk'hambi uko kwe nyika, Togola ni vedi miye niite kaya hadye na kunywa na kugona na mkazangu? Ikindedi hikudaha kudamanya kint'hu enga icho!” <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Niyo Daudi amgamba Ulia, Haya, ikala dyelo aaha. Ivo Ulia niyo asigala mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu mwe dizuwa idyo. Zuwa ditimile, <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi amlalikaga Ulia vileke adye nk'hande na kunywa, niyo amtenda Ulia akolwe. Hata ivo, kilo icho Ulia haitaga kwakwe, ivo agonaga hamwenga na wandima wa seuta.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Mtondo wakwe, Daudi amwandikilaga baluwa Yoabu niyo amwink'ha Ulia amwigaile. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Mwe baluwa iyo Daudi awandikaga ivi, “Mwiike Ulia kulongole, hant'hu ukumanya nk'hondo itendesa, na kumwasa uko niyo weye wauya kunyuma vileke yehe akomigwe.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Umwo Yoabu andaga akautemangiza umzi amwikaga Ulia hant'hu amanyaga hana watowani wadahi wa nk'hondo. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Fyo dya wank'hondo wa dyafosaga na kuwatowa watowani wa Yoabu, wamwenga mwa wandima wa Daudi, wakomagwa, Ulia kulawa mwe dikabila dya Wahiti naye akomagwa.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Niyo, Yoabu egala mbuli zose kwa Daudi akamgambila ivo nk'hondo yandile. <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />Yoabu niyo amsigiila uyo mwigala ulosi akagamba, “Eze ajike kumgambila seuta mbuli zose ze nk'hondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />seuta akanda kaihiwa niyo amuuza, ‘Niii mwiita hagihi no mzi mkatowana? Hamwamanyaga kugamba nawawalaseni ne misale kulawa mwe zikandula zawe? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Niani amkomaga Abimeleki mwana ywa Yelubesheti? Hi yudya mvele yumwenga mwo mzi wa Tebesi yudya akink'haga diiwe dya kusagila kulawa mwo lukandula nadyo niyo dyamkoma Abimeleki? Nii elo, mwita hagihi no lukandula?’ Uneva seuta ana kuuza, weye noumgambe, ‘Hata mndima ywako Ulia Mhiti naye kakomwa.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Yudya asigiilwe aitaga kwa Daudi niyo amgambila yose agambagwa ni Yoabu ayalonge. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Yudya asigiilwe niyo amgamba Daudi, “Wank'hondo wetu wakihuma, wafoselaga kuse yo mizi niyo kukitowa mwe nyika. Hata ivo suwe nekiwagulusa mpaka kwe nk'hili yo mzi. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Niyo wakilasa misale wandima wako nawakomigwa. Hata mndima ywako Ulia kulawa mwe dikabila dya Wahiti naye kakomwa.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi niyo amgamba yudya asigilwe, “Mgambe Yoabu usekwingila chevu kwaviya nk'hondo haina meso, mna mketogeze kutowana mwo mzi uwo, mpaka muwoke mzi uwo. Nivo noumgele ludole Yoabu.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Betisheba mkaza Ulia eze eve kugamba mgosiwe kabanika, amhongezelaga. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Lupisi lwa kuhongeza lwize lusile, Daudi asigiilaga Betisheba egalwe kwe nyumba yakwe. Niyo Betisheba anda mkaza Daudi, naye niyo amwelekela Daudi mwana kilume. Mnungu aihiyagwa mwe mbuli iyo atendile Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nasani amkanya Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu amtumaga mlotezi Nasani kwa Daudi. Nasani niyo aita kwa Daudi, akamgamba, “Kwandaga na wagosi waidi mwo mzi umwenga, yumwenga andaga mgoli na mtuhu naye andaga mkiwa. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Yudya mgoli andaga na ngoto na ng'ombe zibindile ingi. <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />Mna yudya mkiwa andaga na mwate umwenga augulaga. Aukaulisaga niyo wakula hamwenga na wanawe. Amwink'haga nk'hande iidya naakadya yehe, na kuulela vedi, mwate uwo wandaga enga mwana kike ywakwe. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Zuwa dimwenga, mta kwiza aitaga kwa yudya mgoli. Ivo mgoli uyo haungile kuguha ngoto yakwe imwenga hegu ng'ombe vileke amchinjile yudya mta kwiza ywakwe, mna aitaga na kumuhoka idya ngoto yakwe , na kumchinjila yudya mtakwiza ywakwe mkiwa.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Daudi eze eve ayo, andaga na maya mwa yudya mgoli. Na kumgamba mlotezi Nasani, “Nakelisila kwa Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi kugamba mnt'hu adamanye mbuli enga iyo aungwa akomwe! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Vaungwa amlihe mwana ngoto yudya mkiwa, nk'hanana nne, kwaviya kadamanya mbuli ihile naho handile na mbazi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Nasani niyo amgamba Daudi, “Weye ni we mnt'hu uyo.” “Naho aya nayo akulonga Zumbe Mnungu ywa Izilaeli akulonga, ‘Miye hikuika kunda seuta mwa Izilaeli na kukukombola mwo udahi wa Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nakwink'haga nyumba ya mkulu ywako na wavele wakwe wande wako, naho nehikwink'ha want'hu wa Izilaeli na want'hu wa Yuda uwekaile. Naho uneva aya nayanda madodo kwako hegu nehikongezela nk'hanana mbili mwa ayo. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Nii elo, kubela ulosi wangu miye Zumbe Mnungu na kudamanya wiihi uno hangu? Kumkoma Ulia we dikabila dya Wahiti, kwa sime, na kumguha mkaziwe ande mkazio. Kuwatenda Waamoni wamkome Ulia mwe nk'hondo! <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Kwa ivo elo, kwa viya kunibela na kumguha mkaza Ulia Mhiti, ande mkazio, wamwenga mwa welekwa wako nawakomigwe kwa sime ukomi houhauke. <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Naikakilapi kwako kugamba, neniseleze makunt'ho mwa want'hu wako mwenye.Neniwaguhe wakazio na kumwink'ha mbwiyayo, naye naagone nawo mwe kiyeti ivi ukakaula. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Weye nokudamanya mbuli iyo kwa kinyele, mna miye neniyatende ha waizilaeli wose mwe kiyeti.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Ivo, Daudi niyo amgamba Nasani, “Hidamanya wavu mwa Zumbe Mnungu.” Nasani niyo amgamba, “Zumbe Mnungu kakulekela wavu uwo, weye nawe houbanike. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Hata ivo, kwajili yo udamanyi wako kwa kumbela Zumbe Mnungu, mwanao naabanike.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Akajika Nasani niyo auya kaya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Zumbe Mnungu amtowaga umwana yudya Ulia uyo amwelekelaga Daudi, mwana uyo niyo anda mnyonge.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Mwana seuta Daudi abanika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Zumbe Mnungu amtendaga mwana mkaza Ulia amweleke na Daudi kundilisa mnyonge <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi amlombezaga Mnungu kugamba mwana ahone. Afungaga ukudya kint'hu chochose, kilo chose ekalag kwe chumba chakwe akagona hasi mwa magunia. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Wadala vilongozi wakulu we mwe nyumba iyo wambasaga na kumgamba enuke, mna yehe alemelaga, naho hadyaga nk'hande hamwenga nawo. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Mna zuwa dya mfungate kulongole, mwana uyo abanikaga. Wandima wa Daudi wogohaga kumgambila kugamba mwanao kabanika, kwaviya nawafanyanya, “Mwana uyo umwo andile mgima nawalonganya, mna hakitegeleze. Haluse nekimgeeze kugamba mwanao kabanika? Vadahika naakekome!”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi eze akaule wandima wakwe wakatakanizana, abunk'hulaga kugamba mwanawe kabanika. Ivo niyo awauza, “Togoleni mwana kabanika?” Na woho niyo wamhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">“Heye! Kabanika.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Daudi enukaga kulawa hasi na kuhaka mazi. Akehakaga mavuta na kusakanya suke zakwe. Akajika engilaga kwe Nyumba ank'hulu ya Mnungu na kumvika. Eze auye kaya alombezaga nk'hande niyo enk'higwa no kudya. <verse eid="2SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Niho wandima wakwe wamuuza, “Ni mbuli yani ino udamanye? Mwanao umwo andile mgima, weye wafungaga na kumwiila. Mna eze abanike, weye kwinuka na kudya nk'hande!”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi niyo awahitula, “Ni kindedi mwanangu ivo andile mgima, nehifunga na kuila. Nehidamanya ivi kwaviya nehagamba, ‘Niani akumanya? Vadahika Zumbe Mnungu naamtende ande mgima.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Mna haluse kabanika, ya mbwai nifunge? Togoleni miye nadaha kumvuzila ugima? Zuwa dimwenga name neniite uko aitile, mna yehe hakudaha kuuya kwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwelekwa kwa Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Niyo Daudi amsangalaza Betisheba mkaziwe. Niyo agona naye, niyo enula ubovu na kwingila nyumba mwana kilume, uyo Daudi amwitangaga Selemani. Zumbe Mnungu amuungisaga mwana uyo, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />na yehe niyo amsigila mlotezi Nasani kwa Daudi kugamba amwitange mwana uyo Yedidia nuko kugamba Zumbe Mnungu amuungisaga.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi autaha mzi wa Laba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Lupisi ulwo, Yoabu autowaga mzi wa Laba wa Waamoni, na kuutaha mzi uwo we kiseuta. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu niyo asigiila wegala ulosi kwa Daudi, “Hiutaha mzi wa Laba, na kuditozeleza dikawa dyawe dya mazi. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Haluse waduganye watowani wose wasigale, utowe nk'hambi kuuzunguluka na kuutaha. Vituhu vakwe nnautaha miye nowitangwe kwa zina dyangu.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ivo Daudi awaduganyaga fyo dyose dya watowani niyo waita Laba, na kuutowa mzi uwo na kuutaha. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Akajika niyo waguha taji ye kiseuta kulawa mwo mtwi we dihili dya mnungu ywa Waamoni, mnungu Moleki Daudi aiguhaga itaji iyo ye zahabu yandaga na uzami wa kilo milongo mitatu na shano, nayo yandaga na iwe dya yombe kulu. Daudi aguhaga diiwe idyo niyo adimamika mwe tajinyakwe mwenye. Naho atahaga vint'hu vibindile ingi mwo mzi uwo. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Niyo awaguha want'hu wo mzi uwo na kuwaika wadamanye ndima kwa misumeno, sululu za kilama, na hoya ya kilama na kuwatenda wadamanye ndima ya kudamanya matofali, ivo nivo awatendaga want'hu we mizi iyo yose ya Waamoni. Aaho niyo Daudi na fyo dyakwe dya watowani niyo wauya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Amnoni na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Daudi andaga na mwana kike mndele andaga ni lumbudye dya Abisalomu. Uyo andaga lumbudye dya Amnoni mwana mtala, uyo Amnoni amuungisaga. <verse eid="2SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Amnoni asulumilaga vitendese na kuketenda mnyonge kwaajili ya lumbudye Tamali na viya Tamali andile mwali na mazanga, naho neioneka kugamba mbuli iyo heikudahika kwa Amnoni kudamanya chochose. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Mna Amnoni andaga na mbwiyaye etangwagwa Yonadabu mwana Shamu, nduguye Daudi. Yonadabu andaga mnt'hu mbala vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu niyo amgamba Amnoni, “Weye ni mwana seuta, nii wanyala naho waoneka huna kinyemi kila zuwa? Nii hukuunga kunigambila.” Amnoni niyo amgamba, “Namuungisa Tamali, lumbudye dya ndugu yangu Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu niyo amgamba, “Weye kegoneze ho lusazi uketende enga mnyonge. Iso akeza kukusinya, weye mlombeze umgambe, ‘Mlekele lumbudyangu Tamali anigaile mkate nidye, naho anambikile nk'hande akajika anank'hize.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Ivo, Amnoni niyo agendeela kugona mwo lusazi, akaketenda mnyonge. Seuta eze aite kokumkaula, Amnoni amgambaga, “Nakulombeza Tamali eze aha anidamanyile mikate migeke uku hamsinya. Naho yehe mwenye anank'hize.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ivo Daudi atumaga wegala ulosi kwa Tamali kugamba “Aite kwa mkuluwe Amnoni akamdamanyile nk'hande.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Tamali niyo aita, na kumbwila Amnoni kagona. Niyo aguha unga, na kudamanya mikate akanda na Amnoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Mikate iyo ize yajike, Tamali niyo aiyokola kulawa mwe nyungu. Na kumwigaila Amnoni, mna Amnoni alemelaga ukudya, akagamba kila yumwenga afose kuse, niyo wose wahalawa. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Niyo Amnoni amgambila Tamali, “Haluse nigaile mikate iyo kwe chumba changu, niyo wanank'hiza.” Tamali niyo aiguha mikate iyo na kuigala kwe chumba cha mkuluwe Amnoni. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Aho akanda amwink'ha mikate iyo, Amnoni amgwilaga na kumgamba, “Soo kigonanye!”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamali niyo amgamba, “Bule.” “Usekunitigiza. Mbuli ino heikudamanywa mwe isi ino ya Izilaeli. Usekudamanya mbuli ino ya uhezi! <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Miye nenikefisehi ne zisoni izi! Naho weye, nounde yumwenga ywa wahezi mwe Izilaeli. Miye nakulombeza ulonge na seuta kwaviya haakulemeze usekunilomba.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Mna Amnoni haungile kumtegeleza na kwaviya amhumaga ludole niyo agenda naye kwa kumkakalisa.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Niyo, Amnoni amwiihiya Tamali vitendese, kujink'ha hadya nk'hongo amuungisaga. Na kumgamba Tamali, “Halawe aha haluse ivi.”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamali niyo amhitula, “Bule mkulu, mbuli ino ya kunigulusa ihisa vitendese kujink'ha idya unidamanyile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Mna Amnoni haungaga kumtegeleza, <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Amwitangaga mndima ywakwe, akamgamba, “Mhause mvele oyu aha. Naho ulwivi luvugale ne didanga!” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Amnoni na yudya mndima ywakwe wamhausaga na kuvugala ulwivi ne didanga. Tamali andaga kavala valo tali dina mikono mitali enga ivo wakuvala wali na mazanga mwo lupisi lwa seuta. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Ivo, Tamali akehakaga maivu mwo mtwi, na kuditatula valo dyakwe, na kuika mikono yakwe mwo mtwi, niyo ahalawa uku akaila kwa izwi. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Mkuluwe Abisalomu eze amuone, amuuzaga, “Togola mkuluo Amnoni kagona na weye? Lumbu dyangu nyamala. Uyo ni mkuluo du. Usekufanyanya mbuli iyo mwo moyo wako.” Ivo Tamali ekalaga mwe nyumba ya Abisalomu akanda na kinyulu. <verse eid="2SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Seuta Daudi eze eve mbuli iyo aihiyagwa vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abisalomu amwiihiyaga Amnoni vitendese hata kulonga naye, kwaviya amkakalisaga lumbudye Tamali na kugona naye.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu amkoma Amnoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Umwo miyaka miidi ize yomboke, Abisalomu andaga na ndima ya kuzikant'ha ngoto zakwe mazoya mwo mzi wa Baal Hasoli, hagihi no mzi wa Ifulaimu. Awalalikaga wana wose wa seuta. <verse eid="2SA 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abisalomu amwitilaga seuta Daudi, akamgamba, “Kaula miye mndima ywako nnanawo want'hu wakukant'ha ngoto mazoya. Nakulombeza weye seuta na wandima wako, kiitanye hamwenga na miye, mndima ywako?”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Seuta niyo amhitula, “Bule, mwanangu, sema kina kuzamile.” Mna Abisalomu agendeelaga kumlombeza ise, seuta naye alemelaga, mna amvikilaga.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Niyo Abisalomu amgamba, “Uneva howiite, haya mlekele ndugu yangu Amnoni kiite hamwenga?” Seuta niyo amhitula,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">“Mna nii aite hamwenga na nyuwe?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Mna Abisalomu niyo akombekesa kumlombeza, niyo seuta amlekela Amnoni na wanawe wiite kwe kinyemi icho. <verse eid="2SA 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abisalomu niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, “Mkauliseni Amnoni umwo anakolwa na kunda na kinyemi. Aho neniwagambe, ‘Mtoeni Amnoni naho mkomeni.’ Iyo ni sigilizi yangu kwenyu. Kenk'heni ludole naho mnde wadahi!” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Ivo wandima wa Abisalomu wamtendelaga Amnoni enga ivo wasigiilwe ni seuta, na kila yumwenga niyo akwela mwe mp'hunda falasi yakwe na kuguluka.<verse eid="2SA 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Umwo wandaga mwe sila, Daudi evaga kugamba wanawe wose wakomigwa ni Abisalomu hehali hata yumwenga asigale. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Seuta Daudi niyo enuka, akatatula mavalo yakwe kwa kinyulu na kugona hasi. Hata wandima wakwe we hagihi nae watatulaga mavalo yawe. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Mna Yonadabu, mwana ywa Shemea, nduguye Daudi niyo amgamba, “Zumbe ywangu, usekugamba wanawo wose wakomigwa. Amnoni yehe ekedu niye akomigwe. Abisalomu ayamanyaga aya kukongela hadya agendaga na lumbudye Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Ivo, zumbe ywangu, usekufanyanya mwo moyo wako kugamba wanawo wose wakomigwa. Ni Amnoni du akomigwe.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Mna Abisalomu andaga kanyilika kale. Na mndima andile na wamizi, aonaga fyo kulu dya want'hu wakwiza kulawa kwo mnima mwe sila ya Holonaimu. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu niyo amgamba Daudi, “Seuta kaula, wanawo weza enga ivo hugambile miye mndima ywako.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Yudya mndima eze ajike kulonga, wana we kilume wa seuta niyo wengila na kukonga kuila kwa izwi kulu, seuta na wandima wakwe wose niyo waila kwa usungu.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Mna Abisalomu niyo agulukila kwa Talimai mwana ywa Amihudi, seuta ywa mzi wa Geshuli. Daudi niyo amuhongezela mwanawe kwa mazuwa mengi. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abisolomu anyilikilaga kwo mzi wa Geshuli, na kwikala uko kwa miyaka mitatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Seuta Daudi eze ajike kuhongeza ndilo ya mwanawe Amnoni, andaga na nkw'hina ya kumuwona mwanawe Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu auya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana Seluya, amanyaga kugamba seuta Daudi amuonelesa nk'wina Abisalomu du. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ivo awatumaga want'hu uko Tekoa, vileke wamzungule mvele mta umanyi. Weze wamwigale wamgambaga, “Ketende enga wahongeza, uvale suke za kuhongezela naho usekuchana zifili zako uketende enga mvele emwe kuhongeza kwa lupisi lutali. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Akajika ita kwa seuta ukamgambile yadya nohugambile.” Yoabu niyo amgambila zimbuli zo kumgambila seuta.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Uyo mvele kulawa Tekoa niyo aita kwa seuta na kufunamiza kihanga chakwe mpaka hasi kwa kumtunya seuta, akamgamba, “Seuta nambize!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Seuta amuuzaga yudya mvele kugamba, “Una makunt'ho yani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Yudya mvele niyo ahitula, “Kikunisulumiza ni kubanikilwa ni mnumangu. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Miye mndima ywako nandaga na wana kilume waidi. Zuwa dimwenga wakanda kwe nyika, wakongaga nk'humbizi. Kwaviya hahandaga na mnt'hu wa kuwalamula,mwanangu yumwenga niyo amtowa miyawe na kumkoma. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Haluse wandugu zangu wose wanihituka miye mndima ywako, waunga nimlave mwana uyo amkomile miyawe vileke wamkome, ivo nawamkome uyu akaunga ande mkipe. Wanadamanya ivo nawanitende nisigale hiina mwana kilume. Nawadiuse dikawiilo dyangu disigale, naho mnumangu haande na mwana kilume wa kumwiikila zina mwe isi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Seuta niyo amgamba yudya mvele, “Uya kaya, nenilave sigilizi mwe mbuli yako ikaulwe.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Yudya mvele kulawa Tekoa agambaga, “Mkulu ywangu seuta, uneva noupate makunt'ho mwo kuikaula mbuli ino masa yose yande mwangu na mwe mp'huga ya tate. Ivo weye no useuta wako homnde na masa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Mnt'hu yeyose anakutisa mwigale kwangu, uyo heeze ageze naho kukutisa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Nakulombeza unilombezele kwa Zumbe Mnungu, vileke yudya ndugu yangu akuunga alihize kikoda cho ukomi wa mwanangu asekudamanya wavu mkulu kwa kumkoma yudya mwanangu asigale.” Seuta Daudi niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">“Nakelisila kwa Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi, haluhali hata luvili za mwanawo nolutomoke hasi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Miye mndima ywako, nalombeza nilekele nilonge mbuli imwenga du kwako seuta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Seuta niyo amgamba, “Longa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Nii elo kuika mzungu uno wiihile mwa want'hu wa Mnungu? Kumlemeza mwanao mwenye ase kuuya kulawa kudya anyilikile. Kwa ivo mwa ayo ulongile kukesengela mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Suwe chose nekibanike du. Suwe ni enga mazi yetike hasi ayo heyekutekwa naho. Hata Mnungu hakudamanya vituhu mwa mnt'hu uyu na mnt'hu mtuhu, yehe azungula sila ya wadya walemelwe na kunyilika wadahe kuuya. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Naho haluse hiza kuyalonga aya na weye, zumbe ywangu seuta kwaviya want'hu wanitisa. Naivo miye mndima ywako nehifanyanya kugamba, wadaha kukint'hiza kiya hulombeza. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Kwaviya seuta naanitegeleze na kunikombola mwo udahi wa mnt'hu akudaha kunikoma miye na mwanangu kihalawe mwe isi kink'higwe ni Mnungu. <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Mndima ywako name nehifanyanya mwenye kugamba, ulosi wa seuta ywangu nounink'he utondowazi mwo moyo wangu ni enga mtumigwa ywa Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu mwo kutalaula yaihile na ayedi. Zumbe Mnungu ywako ande hamwenga na weye!”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Seuta niyo amhitula yudya mvele akamgamba, “Usekunifisa mbuli yeyose nohuuze” Yudya mvele niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">“Niuze du zumbe ywangu seuta.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Seuta niyo amuuza, “Togola Yoabu hamuli mwe mbuli ino?” Yudya mvele niyo agamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">“Enga ivo ukugendeela kunda mgima seuta ywangu, mnt'hu hakudaha kukehonya kwa vovose mwe mbuli ino ulongile seuta ywangu. Yoabu yudya mndima ywako niye anitumile. Ni yehe anigambile mbuli izi zose hukugambila miye mndima ywako. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu alongaga ivo vileke mbuli zikale vedi. Mna weye mkulu ywangu, una mizungu enga mtumigwa ywa Mnungu ywa kwe mbingu, naho kumanya mbuli zose zili mwe isi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Niyo, seuta amgamba Yoabu, “Ni vedi, nenitende ivo ukuunga vinde. Genda kamguhe mbwanga Abisalomu umvuze aha hakaya.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu afunamizaga kihanga chakwe kwa kumtunya seuta ywakwe akagamba, “Dyelo miye mndima ywako, seuta ywangu, himanya kugamba hizumilwa kwako, kwa kuzumila kulombeza kwangu.” <verse eid="2SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ivo Yoabu, ahalawaga, na kuita Geshuli akamvuze Abisalomu mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Mna seuta niyo agamba, “Abisalomu ekale kwe kaya yakwe. Hikuunga kikakaulana.” Ivo Abisalomu niyo ekala hale kwe kaya yakwe, naho hamuonaga seuta.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu na Daudi waivana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Mwe izilaeli yose hakwanda na yeyose atogolwagwa kwa utana enga Abisalomu. Kukongela kwe zinyayo zakwe mpaka mwe difofo dyakwe, Abisalomu handaga na lema dodyose. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Yeha mwenye azionaga fili zakwe kugamba zizama, naho andaga akapucha lumwenga mwo mwaka umwo zikanda zikulisa na kumzamila. Uzami akwe wajink'haga kilo mbili viligane ne vihimo ve kiseuta. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abisalomu apataga wana watatu wa kilume hamwenga na ywa kike yumwenga etangwagwa Tamali, Tamali andaga mndele ahombweele vitendese.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Ivo, Abisalomu ekala mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu kwa lupisi lwa miyaka miidi haheina kumuwona seuta. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Niyo, Abisalomu amwigaila ulosi Yoabu, vileke amsigile kwa seuta, mna Yoabu alemelaga. Abisalomu niyo asigiila naho Yoabu naye niyo alemela naho. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ivo, Abisalomu niyo awagamba wandima wakwe, “Kauleni, Yoabu ana mgunda wa Shaili hagihi no mgunda wangu, iteni mkauwoke.” Ivo wandima wa Abisalomu niyo wagenda kuwoka mgunda wa Yoabu.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu niyo aita kaya kwa Abisalomu na kumuuza, “Nii wandima wako woka mgunda wangu?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abisalomu niyo amhitula Yoabu, “Kaula nehikwigaila ulosi wize uku hutume kwa seuta ukamuuze, ‘Nii nehi halawa Geshuli? Neinda ni vedi kwangu nasigale uuko.’ ” “Haluse nambize nimuone seuta. Uneva nna masa mneke anikome.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Ivo Yoabu agendaga kumgambila seuta mbuli zose. Seuta naye niyo amwitanga Abisalomu aitaga kwa seuta na kufunamiza kihanga chakwe hasi kwa kumtunya seuta, naye seuta niyo amhokelaga na kumnonela Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu amwikila Daudi mzungu wiihile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Mwo kwajika mbuli iyo, Abisalomu akeikilaga magali yakugendezwa ne zifalasi na want'hu milongo mishano wakumlongoela. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abisalomu azoelaga kwinuka mtondo na kuita kukimala he sila ikuhinga kwe nk'hili yo mzi. mnt'hu yeyose mta malongelezo ayo akuunga kumwigaila seuta vileke apate ulamuzi, Abisalomu amwitangaga hank'handa mnt'hu uyo na kumuuza, “Walawa mzi wani?” Uneva mnt'hu uyo analonga kalawa mzi mtuhu we dikabila dya Izilaeli, <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abisalomu naamgambe, “Malongelezo yako ni ya kindedi. Mna hahali mnt'hu yeyose akuunga akutegeleze.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Naho, Abisalomu naamgambe, “Uneva miye nandile mlamuzi ywa Izilaeli! Kila mnt'hu mta malongelezo hegu masa naakeza kwangu, na miye nehimwink'ha uwagilwa wakwe.” <verse eid="2SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Akajika ayo, Abisalomu aumkumbatila na kumnonela mnt'hu yeyose ezile kumfunamizila mtwi wakwe hasi kwa kumtunya. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Ivo, nivo Abisalomu awatendile want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wezaga kuunga ulamuzi wa seuta. Kwa kudamanya ivo, Abisalomu aungisagwa ni Waizilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Miyaka mine ize yomboke, Abisalomu amgambaga seuta, “Nakulombeza unilekele niite uko Hebuloni vileke nikint'hize kilapi changu icho namwikilaga Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />kwaviya miye mndima ywako, umwo nekalaga kudya Geshuli mwe Asilia, nakelisilaga kwa Zumbe Mnungu hagamba uneva Zumbe Mnungu naanivuze mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu nenimvike yehe.”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Haya ita kwa utondowazi.” Abisalomu niyo ahalawa kuita Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Mna Abisalomu atumaga wegala ulosi kwa kinyele mwe makabila yose ya Izilaeli, “Aaho nomwiive izwi dya gunda, gambeni, ‘Abisalomu niye seuta ywa Hebuloni!’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abisalomu eze aite uko Hebuloni, aitaga na want'hu magana maidi awo awalalikaga kulawa Yelusalemu, woho nawo waitaga uko kwa wedi, naho hawamanyaga chochose mwo mzungu wa Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Aho Abisalomu andaga akalava nt'hambiko, atumaga wegala ulosi mwo mzi wa Gilo kumwitanga Ahitofeli uyo Mgilo, andaga mlangilizi wa seuta Daudi. Kusaguka kwa Abisalomu watendesaga na udahi wa want'hu andaga nawo wakatenda kugenyela.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seuta Daudi anyilika Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Mwigala ulosi aitaga kwa Daudi niyo amgamba, “Want'hu wa Izilaeli wamuunga Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ivo, Daudi niyo awagamba wakulu wa watowani wakwe andaga nawo uko Yelusalemu, “Inukeni kisunguze kuhalawa, vituhu vakwe hekidahe kumnyilika Abisalomu. Kikombeke sema anasunguze kwiza na kukikoma suwe na kila mnt'hu mwo mzi!”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Mna wandima wakwe niyo wamgamba, “Suwe wandima wako mkulu ywetu, kikeika lumwe kwa dyodyose noukigambile kidamanye.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ivo, seuta niyo ahalawa na want'hu wakwe, mna niyo awaleka wawele mlongo vileke wadamanye ndima za mwe nyumba.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Seuta niyo ahalawa na want'hu wakwe wose, weze wabule mwe nyumba yo uheelo mwo mzi uwo waikaga nt'hulwe. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Wandima wose wa seuta, Wakeleti wose hamwenga na Wagati magana mtandatu wamtimile seuta Daudi kulawa mwo mzi wa Gati, wahalawaga hamwenga naye wakamtongela. <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Niyo, seuta Daudi eze amuone Itai uyo Mgiti, amgambaga, “Nii hata weye kulongozana hamwenga na suwe? Uya wikale na seuta Abisalomu. Kwaviya weye ni mta kwiza uku, naho ni mnt'hu alawile kwawe. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Weye kwiza zuzi du aha. Togola houtende mnt'hu ywa kwangadika hamwenga na suwe, handa himanyize kudya huwita? Uya kwe kaya hamwenga na wanduguzo. Naye Zumbe Mnungu akulagise uwedi na uhuwilwa wakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Mna Itai niyo amhitula seuta, “Enga ivo Mnungu eli mgima na ivo eli mgima seuta ywetu, hohose aho nowiite, ikanda kubanika hegu mgima, na miye mndima ywako neninde aaho.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Ivo, Daudi niyo amgamba Itai, “Haluse longola.” Ivo Itai uyo Mgiti niyo aita hamwenga na wanawe. <verse eid="2SA 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Daudi umwo akomboka hamwenga na want'hu wakwe, want'hu wose mwe isi nawakaila kwa izwi. Seuta Daudi ombokaga mwe kazuto ka Kidiloni hamwenga na want'hu wakwe kuhinga kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Mlavant'hambiko Abiatali niyo afosa, hamwenga na mlavant'hambiko Sadoki hamwenga na Walawi wose uku wakenula Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu, na kudiika hasi mpaka want'hu wose weze womboke kulawa mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Niyo seuta amgamba Sadoki, “Divuze Disanduku dye Ndagano dya Mnungu mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Uneva nazumilwa ha Mnungu haheina wogohi, naanivuze nidione naho Disanduku dya Ndagano na kuona hant'hu aho dikwikala. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Mna inanda Zumbe Mnungu hakuwaagilwa na miye, miye hizumila anitende dyodyose idyo akuunga.” <verse eid="2SA 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Seuta Daudi niyo naho amgamba Sadoki, “Tegeleza, mguhe mwanawo Ahimaasi na Yonasani mwana Amitai muuye kaya kwa utondowazi. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Mna neninde hagoja mwo mdando uko kwe nyika, mpaka aho neniive mbuli kulawa kwako.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Kwaivo Sadoki na Abitai nawavuza Disanduku dya Ndagano dya Mnungu mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu, na kwikala uumwo.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Mna Daudi agendeelaga kukwela mwo mnima wa Mizeituni uku akaila, haheina vilatu uku mtwi wakwe ugubikwe. Hata want'hu wose andile nawo nawagubika mitwi yawe wakakwela mnima uku wakaila. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Mwo lupisi ulwo Daudi agambilagwa kugamba hata Ahitofeli andaga yumwenga wa wank'hondo awo wakelunganyaga na Abisalomu. Mna Daudi niyo alombeza akagamba, “Weye Zumbe nakulombeza uutende mzungu wa Ahitofeli usekukint'ha!”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi eze abule mwo lunenengwa lwo mnima, hant'hu ha kumvika Mnungu, mnt'hu yumwenga zina dyakwe Hushai kulawa Aki ezaga vileke amsingile, mavalo yakwe yakanda yatatuka na mwo mtwi wakwe kuna luvumbi. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi niyo amgamba, “Unaita hamwenga na miye, nounde enga nt'wika kwangu. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Mna uneva nouuye mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu na kumgamba Abisalomu kugamba, nounde mndima ywakwe, weye seuta enga ivo nandile mndima wa iso aho nk'hongo, ivo nounde kunambiza kwa kuutenda mzungu wa Ahitofeli usekukint'ha, <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />walavant'hambiko Sadoki na Abiatali weyaho hamwenga na weye mwo mzi, ivo chochose nowive, wagambile walavant'hambiko Sadoki na Abiatali. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Kaula, wana wawe waidi wa kilume weyaho. Ahimaasi mwana Sadoki na Yonatani mwana Abiatali we hamwenga na weye, na chochose nomkiive nouwasigiile weze wanigambile.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ivo, Hushai mbwiyaye dya seuta Daudi, niyo auya mwo mzi naho mwo lupisi ulo Abisalomu akengila mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daudi eze ajink'he holunenengwa lwo mnima, Siba uyo mndima ywa Mefibosheti amsingilaga Daudi akanda na mp'hunda mbili izo zinule mikate magana maidi, vikwanya gana va zabibu zinyaile na matunda gana yahomoke na shupa imemile divai. <verse eid="2SA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Seuta Daudi niyo amuuza Siba, “Nii kwigala vint'hu ivi?” Siba niyo amhitula, “Mp'hunda ni kwaajili ya want'hu wako, na mikate na matunda ni kwaajili ya wabwanga wako wose, na divai ni kwaajili ya wadya nawasokelese mwe dijangwa.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Seuta niyo amuuza, “Mefibosheti mwana ywa mkulu ywako ekuhi?” Siba niyo amgamba seuta,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">“Yehe kasigala Yelusalemu kwaviya afanyanya kugamba want'hu wa Izilaeli nawamvuzile useuta wa Sauli babakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Seuta niyo amgamba Siba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">“Ivo yadya yandaga ugoli wa Mefibosheti haluse ni ugoli wako.” Siba niyo amgamba, “Nivedi mkulu ywangu seuta, na miye naunga wedi hako mazuwa yose!”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi na Shimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Mwo lupisi Daudi eze abule Bahulimu, alailaga mnt'hu yumwenga ywa lukolo lwa Sauli, zina dyakwe etangwa Shimei mwana Gela, niyo akonga kumligita Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Shimei akongaga kumvigitila maiwe Daudi hamwenga na wakulu wakwe wa watowani, hata ivo seuta Daudi andaga kazunguluwa ni wakulu wa watowani na wamizi wakwe kulume na kumoso. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei amligitaga Daudi akagamba, “Halawe aha, weye mnt'hu mkomi, mnt'hu hi kint'hu! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Zumbe Mnungu kakulihila kilapi kwaviya ya kuitila sakame yose ya want'hu wa Sauli, uwo haluse weye kuuguha useuta wakwe. Haluse Zumbe Mnungu kamwink'ha Abisalomu mwanawo. Kaula ubanangi ukupata kwaviya weye mkomi!”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Niho Abishai mwana Seluya, akamgamba seuta, “Nii kuli idi dibanike dikuligite mkulu? Nilekele niite na miye nenikant'he mtwi wakwe!”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Mna seuta niyo amgamba, “Togoleni kuna mbwai mwa miye na Seluya? Uneva Zumbe Mnungu kamgamba, Mligite Daudi, niani akudaha kuuza kugamba nii ukadamanya ivo?” <verse eid="2SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Naho seuta Daudi niyo amgamba Abishai na wandima wakwe wose, “Uneva mwanangu mwenye aunga anikome, togoleni hi kujink'ha ya mnt'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini? Nyuwe mlekeni aniligite kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kamgamba aniligite. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Mafani Zumbe Mnungu naakaule makunt'ho yako, yehe naye niyo aniliha uwedi kwa ligito idi hupata dyelo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Ivo seuta Daudi na want'hu wakwe wagendeelaga ne nt'hambo yawe uku Shimei akamtimila kunyuma na kumduila maiwe na kumyagila sanga seuta Daudi. Shimei andaga akagenda mwe diwandamo dyo mnima, mnk'handa na seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Niyo seuta hamwenga na want'hu wakwe wandile hamwenga naye, wabula ho mto Yolodani wakanda wasokelesa. Ivo niyo waika nt'hulwe.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Mwo lupisi ulwo, Abisalomu na want'hu wakwe wose wa Izilaeli waitaga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu hamwenga na Ahitofeli. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Hushai wo mzi wa Aliki mbwiyaye Daudi, amwitilaga Abisalomu, akamgamba, “Wikalise mazuwa yose seuta!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abisalomu niyo amuuza Hushai, “Togola, ulu nulo lukunde lwako kwa mbwiyayo Daudi? Nii huitile hamwenga na mbwiyayo?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai niyo amhitula, “Bule! Kwaviya yudya kasagulwa ni Zumbe Mnungu na want'hu awa hamwenga na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli, uyo niye neninde naye mazuwa yose. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Akajika ayo, togola ni yuhi nenimdamanyile ndima? Ivo, enga ivo nimdamanyile ndima iso nivo nohudamanyile weye.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Niho Abisalomu amgambaga Ahitofeli, “Nigambile kidamanyei?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli niyo amgamba Abisalomu, “Gona na wawele wa iso awo awasaga wakaulage inyumba yakwe. Aho niho kila yumwenga mwe Izilaeli naamanye kugamba iso akuona kunda mnk'hondo ywakwe, ivo wose we hamwenga na weye nawpate ludole.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Ivo, want'hu niyo wamwikila Abisalomu hema kulanga kwe ditembe, naye niyo agona uuko na wawele wa ise, want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wakanda wakaula.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Zuwa idyo, ulangilizi wowose alavile Ahitofeli nounda enga ulavigwa ni Mnungu. Na ulangilizi wowose alavile Ahitofeli nouzumilwa ni Daudi na Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai amzaganya Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Akajika ayo, Ahitofeli amgambaga Abisalomu, “Nilekele nisagule want'hu alufu mlongo na waidi nihalawe nawo nimbase Daudi kilo cha dyelo. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Nenimtowe akanda kasokela na kwingila chevu, naho miye neni mtise. Want'hu wose ana nawo nawanyilike. Nenimkome seuta yehe ekedu, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kuwavuza want'hu wose kwako enga mta ndoza akuita kwa mgosiwe. Kubanika kwa mnt'hu yumwenga nokuwatende want'hu wose wauye nawo want'hu wose nawande na utondowazi.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Mzungu uwo nouoneka kwa Abisalomu na kwa wadala vilongozi wose wa Izilaeli kunda wedi.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Abisalomu niyo agamba, “Mwitangeni Hushai, kulawa Aliki, kive kiya naalonge.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai eze abule kwa Abisalomu, Abisalomu amuuzaga, “Ivo nivo alongile Ahitofeli. Togola kidamanye enga ivo alongile? Uneva hiyo ivo, haya kigambile ivo ukuona ni vedi.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai niyo amhitula Abisalomu, “Ulangilizi alavile Ahitofeli mwo lupisi ulu hiyo wedi, <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />kwaviya kumanya kugamba iso na want'hu wakwe wadahi naho waihiwa enga simba ihokigwe wanawe, naho, kumanya kugamba iso mtowani mdahi ywa nk'hondo. Yehe haageze kwikala kilo chose hamwenga na watowani wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Hata ivi haluse kakefisa kale mwe zimp'hanga za uko hegu hant'hu hatuhu. Mnt'hu yeyose neeve kukomwa kwa want'hu naagambe want'hu wa Abisalomu awhumigwa. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Naho hata watowani wako wadahi wata mioyo enga simba, nawengile chevu kwa wogohi umwo wakeza kwiva ivo, kwaviya Waizilaeli wamanya kugamba iso mdahi na wadya wose eli nawo wadahi. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Ivo ulangilizi wangu ni uno, uwaduganye want'hu wose wa Izilaeli kukongela Dani nt'hendelo ya kasikazini mpaka Beel Sheba, uko kwa mwenye mzi, wande wengi enga sanga wa bahali, weye nawe wiite kwe nk'hondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Naho nekimzungule niyo chamkump'hukila Daudi enga mnyuzu hohose aho naande, umwo akanda hamanyize ni kihi kikulaila. Inde yehe hegu yeyose mwa watowani wakwe, hehali naasigale mgima. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />Uneva ananyilikila mwo mzi wowose, want'hu wose wa Izilaeli nawegale sigi niyo wauzinganiza mzi uwo izisigi, niyo chaubulumula mzi uwo wose mpaka kwe dikolongo, kisekusigala hata iwe dodo dya mwo mzi uwo.” <verse eid="2SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abisalomu hamwenga na want'hu wose wa Izilaeli wagambaga, “Ulangilizi wa Hushai ni wedi kujink'ha udya wa Ahitofeli.” Mna ino yandaga ni kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu kaika mzungu wa kugamba ulangilizi wa Ahitofeli use kutimilwa vileke adahe kumwigaila Abisalomu file yakwe.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi akanywa na kunyilika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Niyo Hushai awagambilaga walavant'hambiko Sadoki na Abiatali ivo yehe na Ahitofeli wamlangilize Abisalomu na wadala vilongozi wa Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Awagambaga wasunguze kumwigaila ulosi Daudi kugamba asekugona nekilo mwe midando ya mwe dijangwa, mna asunguze kudendeluka umto Yolodani sema anagwiligwe na kukomwa yehe hamwenga na want'hu wakwe wose.<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Mwo lupisi ulo, Yonasani na Ahimaasi wakefisaga hagihi na kazuto ka Eni Logeli, vileke wasekuonwa ni mnt'hu yeyose wakeingila mwo mzi. Kila zuwa mndima ywa kike andaga akawegaila ulosi, nawo niyo wawigala kwa seuta Daudi kugamba hawakadaha kukomwa uneva wanaonwa ni want'hu wakengila mwo mzi. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Mna mwo lupisi ulu, waonekaga na mbwanga yumwenga uyo agendaga kumgambila Abisalomu. Ivo, Yonasani na Ahimaasi wasunguzaga kuhalawa, niyo waita Bahulimu mwe kaya ya mnt'hu mtuhu andile na sima dyakwe kwo uwa. Wengilaga mwe disima idyo niyo wakefisa. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Mkaziwe dya uyo mta inyumba aguhaga ngubiko iyo niyo agubika disima idyo, anjazaga uhule mnanga mwe ngubiko iyo, naho hakwandaga na yeyose amanyaga imbuli iyo. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Watowani wa Abisalomu weze wabule kwa uyo mvele, wamuuzaga, “Wehii Ahimasi na Yonasani?” Yudya mvele niyo awahitula, “Wadendeluka kazuto.” Wawazungulaga mna hawa waonaga, ivo niyo wauya kwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Watowani wa Abisalomu weze wahalawe, Yonasani na Ahimaasi wafosaga mwe disima, niyo wagenda kumgambila seuta Daudi wamgambaga, “Sunguza udendeluke kazuto. Ino ni kwaviya Ahitofeli na Abisalomu waikaga mzungu wiihile mwa yehe.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Kwaivo, Daudi niyo ahalawa na want'hu wakwe wandile hamwenga naye, wadendelukaga mto Yolodani. Kwize kuche mtondo wose wandaga wadendeluka kale mto Yolodani<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli eze aone kugamba ulangilizi wakwe hautimilwe, aiikaga lumwe imp'hunda yakwe na kukeuiya kaya kwo mzi wakwe. Eze abule uko aikaga vedi mbuli za mwe kaya yakwe, akenyulikaga na kubanika. Amoselwagwa msanga kwe kikuta che mp'huga ya ise.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Ivo, Daudi niyo aita Mahanaimu niyo Abisalomu naye na watowani wakwe wadendeluka mto Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Mwo lupisi ulo, Abisalomu amsagulaga Amasa kunda mkulu wa watowani hant'hu ha Yoabu. Amasa andaga mwana ywa mnt'hu yumwenga etangwagwa Yeteli mwelekwa ywa Ishumaili. Nine dya Amasa andaga ni Abigaili naho andaga mwana kike ywa Nahashi naho ni lumbudye dya Zeluya nine dya Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Abisalomu hamwenga na watowani wa Izilaeli waikaga nk'hambi yawe mwe isi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daudi eze abule Mahanaimu, Shobi mwana ywa Nashani uyo Mwamoni kulawa mzi wa Laba, Makili mwana ywa Amieli kulawa mzi wa Lo Debali hamwenga na Balizilai kulawa mwe dikabila dya Mgileadi kulawa mzi wa Logelimu, <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />wegalaga vigonelo na mabilika na vyombo va ulongo na ngano na Shaili na unga, na nk'hunde, <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />uki na ngoto na mabongo kulawa mwe mifugwa vnyawe kwajili ya Daudi hamwenga na want'hu andile nawo, kwaviya nawagamba want'hu awa wana sala, naho wasokelesa naho wana nk'hilu uko kwe dijangwa.<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu ahumigwa na kukomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi awawazaga watowani andile nawo, na kuika mwawe wakulu wa watowani alufu na wakulu ywa watowani magana. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi niyo awatuma watowani wakwe kwe nk'hondo mwe mafyo matatu. Fyo dimwenga di mwa Yoabu, na fyo dya kaidi di mwa Abishai mwana ywa Seluya nduguye dya Yoabu na fyo dya katatu di mwa Itai kulawa mwe dikabila dya Wagiti. Niyo Daudi awagambila wose, “Miye mwenye neninde hamwenga na nyuwe.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Mna watowani niyo wamgamba, “Houfose, kwaviya kinanyilika hawakitimile. Hata uneva neinde nusu ya watowani wetu nawabanike, hawangadike na suwe. Mna weye ni mnt'hu hwikuungwa kuswesekana kujink'ha want'hu alufu mlongo. Ivo ni vedi weye usigale aha mwo mzi na kukigaila vint'hu ukanda kwo mzi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Seuta niyo awagamba, “Dyodyose mkuona ni dyedi, nenidamanye.” Ivo, seuta niyo akimala mnk'handa mwe nk'hili, uku watowani wakwe wokomboka, magana na maelufu. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Seuta niyo amgamba Yoabu, Abishai na Itai, “Kwaajili yangu, mdamanyileni uwedi yudya mbwanga Abisalomu.” Watowani wose wamwivaga seuta akawasiigiila wakulu wa watowani wakwe.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Ivo, watowani wa Daudi niyo waita kwe nyika na kutowana na want'hu wa Izilaeli. Nk'hondo iyo neinda kwe mbago ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Watowani wa Daudi wawahumaga Waizilaeli. Ukomi wa zuwa idyo nayanda makulu kwaviya want'hu alufu milongo miidi nawakomigwa. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Kutowana uko nokugendeela mwe isi yose na want'hu wengi wabanikaga mwe mbago kujink'ha wadya wakomigwe na sime.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Niyo Abisalomu akanda kakwela mwe mp'hunda falasi, abwilanaga na watowani ywa Daudi. Mp'hunda falasi iyo ikanda yomboka hasi yo mti wa mwaloni, aho mtwi wa Abisalomu niyo wafinyilizwa mwo mwaloni, Abisalomu niyo alekwa uku akahweela kulanga. mna mp'hunda falasi yakwe yagendeelaga kuita. <verse eid="2SA 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Mnt'hu mtuhu aone mbuli iyo, amgambaga Yoabu, “Himuona Abisalomu akahweela mwe mwaloni!”<verse eid="2SA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu niyo amgamba mnt'hu uyo, “Mbwai? Kumuwona Abisalomu? Naho nii humkomile aho? Hegu nehitogola naho nehikwink'ha vibesu mlongo va masawa.” <verse eid="2SA 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Mna yudya mnt'hu niyo amgamba Yoabu, “Hata una nink'ha vibesu alufu va masawa, hyagezile kumtowa mwana seuta. Kwaviya nekimwiva seuta akakusigiila weye Abisshai na Itai kugamba, ‘Mmwamile mbwanga Abisalomu.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />Vituhu vakwe, uneva nehimtendela uwihi, naho hahana dikefisile ha seuta, weye mwenye nokunilemela.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu niyo amgamba, “Miye hina lupisi lwa kwaza miye na weye.” Aho Yoabu niyo aguha mijungo midodo mitatu, niyo agenda kumjunga Abisalomu mo moyo, Abisalomu andaga akei mgima akahweela mwe ditambi dya mwaloni. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Niyo watowani mlongo wamwinuile vitowanilo Yoabu, wezaga na kumzunguluka Abisalomu, wamtowaga na kumbindiliza.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Naho Yoabu atowaga gunda, watowani wose wauyaga na kuwatimila want'hu wa Izilaeli, kwaviya Yoabu awalemezaga. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Niyo waguha kimba cha Abisalomu na kukiduula mwe dibome dikulu mwe mbago na kuumbika lundo kulu dya maiwe mnanga mwakwe. Want'hu wose wa Izilaeli niyo waguluka, kila yumwenga kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Abisalomu mwo lupisi lwakwe, andaga kakezengela mkola wa nk'humbukila mwe dikolongo dya seuta, kwaviya agambaga, miye hina mwana kilume wa kutenda zina dyangu digendeele kukumbukilwa. Mkola uwo awink'haga zina dyakwe mkola wa Abisalomu mpaka ivi dyelo.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi agambilwa file ya Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Niyo, Ahimaasi mwana Sadoki agambaga, “Nilekeleni niite hamgambile seuta mbuli izi kugamba Zumbe Mnungu kamkombola mwo udahi wa wank'hondo wakwe.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu niyo amgamba, “Dyelo howigale mbuli izo. Wadaha kwigala mbuli izo zuwa tuhu kwaviya mwana seuta kabanika” <verse eid="2SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Niho Yoabu amgamba mtuhu yumwenga, Mkushi, “Weye ita ukamgambile seuta yadya uyaone.” Mkushi niyo afunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi mwa Yoabu, na kuguluka kuita kwa seuta. <verse eid="2SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Niyo Ahimaasi mwana Sadoki amgambaga Yoabu naho, nakulombeza nilekele du nimgulukile yudya Mkushi. Yoabu niyo amgamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">“Togola mwanangu nii waunga unyilike? Weye hougelekwe chochose mwe mbuli ino.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi niyo amgamba, Heye, guluka, Niyo Ahimaasi aguluka na kutimila sila ya kwe mbago na kumjink'ha yudya Mkushi.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Daudi andaga kekala mwe nk'hili yo kwingila mwo mzi, mwamizi we nk'hili naye akwelaga mwo lukandula mpaka kulanga ye nk'hili naho eze akaule amuonaga mnt'hu akaguluka ekedu. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Uyo mwamizi atowaga lwasu akamgamba seuta. Seuta niyo agamba, “Uneva ekedu, uyo ana mbuli yedi du.” Yudya mnt'hu niyo anda hagihi.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Mwamizi amuonaga mnt'hu mtuhu andaga akaguluka na kwitanga naho mwamizi ywe nk'hili akagamba, “Kaula mnt'hu mtuhu aguluka ekedu. Seuta niyo agamba uyo naye egala mbuli.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Yudya mwamizi niyo agamba, “Naona kugamba yudya agulukisa kujink'ha Ahimaasi mwana Sadoki</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">“Seuta niyo agamba uyo ni mnt'hu ywedi, akigaila mbuli zedi.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Niho Ahimaasi akwezaga izwi ha seuta akagamba, mbuli zose ni zedi. Afunamiza mtwi wakwe mpaka hasi kwa kumtunya akagamba, “Atogolwe Zumbe Mnungu, Mnungu ywako akukombole kulawa kwa want'hu nawaka kusezenga, mkulu ywangu seuta!”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Togola, mbwanga Abisalomu evihi? Ahimaasi niyo ahitula, umwo Yoabu eze anitume miye mndima ywako, nehiona kuna lwasu, mna hyamanyize nokulailai.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Seuta niyo agamba, “Ikala hank'handa naho ukimale aaho.” Ivo Ahimaasi asogelaga na kukimala hank'handa.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Niyo yudya Mkushi abula niyo agamba, “Kuna mbuli yedi kwako mkulu ywangu seuta, kwaviya Zumbe Mnungu dyelo kakukombola mwa wadya wose nawakaunga wakukome!”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Seuta niyo amuuza, “Togola mbwanga Abisalomu evihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Mkushi niyo agamba, “Mkulu, wank'hondo wako na wadya wose, nawakaunga wakukome enga uyo mbwanga Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Aaho seuta niyo anda na kinyulu, akwelaga kwe chumba chakwe cha kulanga che nyumba mwe nk'hili na kuila. Umwo andaga akakwela, andaga akaila akagamba, “Hoo mwanangu Abisalomu, mwanangu Abisalomu! Nevinda vedi nabanike miye kujink'ha weye mwanangu Abisalomu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu amtivila seuta Daui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu agambilagwa kugamba seuta andaga akaila na kuhongeza mwe file ya Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Kwa ivo uhumi mwe dizuwa idyo nounda wa kuhongeza kwa watowani wose, weze weve seuta amuhongezela Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Ivo zuwa idyo want'hu wengilaga mwo mzi kwa kinyele enga want'hu wakuuya mwo mzi wakaona soni kwa kunyilika nk'hondo. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Seuta agubikaga futa yakwe na kuila kwa izwi kulu akagamba, “Hoo mwanangu Abisalomu! Hoo mwanangu Abisalomu!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Niho Yoabu abulaga kaya kwa seuta akamgamba, “Dyelo kukigela soni suwe wandima wako wose awo dyelo kiukombole wikazi wako na wikazi wa wanawo wa kilume na wikazi wa wanawo we kike na wikazi wa want'hu wako na wawele wako. <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />Weye wawaunga wadya wakukuihiya naho wawaihiya wadya wakukuunga. Kukilagisa pwilili kugamba wakulu wa watowani na watowani wawe hi kint'hu kwako. Naona kugamba dyelo Abisalomu andile mgima, suwe naswe chabanike, hegu weye nokunda na kinyemi. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Haluse kimala ukawagele moyo. kwaviya nakelisa kwa Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi kugamba, uneva hukuita kulonga nawo, hehali hata yumwenga naande hamwenga na weye dyelo kisingi. Ino neinde mbuli ihise kwako kujink'ha uwihi wako uutendile kukongela mwo ubwanga wako.” <verse eid="2SA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Ivo seuta afosaga na kugenda kwikala ho ukalo wakwe hagihi ne nk'hili. Want'hu wose weze wagambilwe kugamba seuta ekwe nk'hili wamwitilaga.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Daudi afunganya kuuya Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Mafyo yose ya watowani wa Izilaeli ayo yandaga hamwenga na Abisalomu yauyaga kwe zikaya zawe. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Want'hu wose nawanda wakahigana woho kwa woho mwe makabila yose ya Izilaeli, wakagamba, “seuta Daudi akiyokolaga mwo udahi wa wank'hondo wetu, naho akiyokolaga mwo udahi wa Wafilisiti. Mna haluse kainyilika isi akamnyilka Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />Naho Abisalomu uyo kimwikile kunda seuta ywetu, haluse kakomwa kwe nk'hondo. Haluse nii hakikulonga mwo kumvuza seuta Daudi?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Seuta Daudi niyo atuma wegala ulosi kwa mlavant'hambiko Sadoki na Abitali, Wagambileni wadala vilongozi wa Yuda, “Nii woho wanda want'hu wa kunyuma kumvuza seuta mwe kaya yakwe? Kiya walongile Waizilaeli hikiiva miye seuta. <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Nyuwe wandugu zangu, naho ni sakame yangu, nii mwanda want'hu wa kunyuma kunivuza miye seuta mwe kaya yangu?” <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Daudi awagambaga mgambeni Amasa kugamba, “Yehe naye sakame yangu. Naho Mnungu naanikome uneva himtendile kunda mkulu we difyo dyangu dya watowani kukongela dyelo kujink'ha Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Ivo Daudi awatendaga want'hu wose wa Yuda wamzumile enga mnt'hu yumwenga. Ivo niyo wamwigaila ulosi kugamba auye kaya weye na wandima wako wose.<verse eid="2SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ivo seuta niyo eza mto Yolodani na want'hu wose wa Yuda niyo weza mpaka Giligali kumsingila seuta na kumombosa mto Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shemei mwana Gela ywe dikabila dya Benjamini kulawa Bahalimu, asunguzaga kuita na want'hu watuhu vileke wamsingile seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Shimei aitaga hamwenga na want'hu we dikabila dya Benjamini alufu imwenga. Siba mndima ywa mbuyaye ywa Sauli hamwenga na wanawe mlongo na wandima milongo miidi, waitaga nawo kwo mto Yolodani wakamsingile seuta Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Ivo wombokaga mto Yolodani vileke waitanye hamwenga na mbuyaye dya seuta na kumdamanyila seuta yadya yose yaungaga. Shimei mwana Gela niyo eza na kufunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi kwa kumtunya, mwo lupisi seuta andaga hagihi na kudendeluka mto Yolodani.<verse eid="2SA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amlagisa uwedi wakwe Shimei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Shimei niyo amgamba seuta, “Nakulombeza usekufanyanya uwihi udya hudamanyile umwo wahalawaga yelusalemu usekugendeela kuufanyanya. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kwaviya miye mndima ywako himanya kugamba nehidamanya wavu. Ivo nivo vikuleka hiza dyelo, nehinda ywa nk'hongo mwe dikabila dya Yusufu, kwiza kukusingila weye mkulu ywangu seuta.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Niho Abishai mwana Seluya niyo agamba, “Togola hikugamba vaungwa Shimei akomwe kwaviya amligitaga mnt'hu uyo akumbagwa mvuta ni Zumbe Mnungu mwenye?”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Mna Daudi niyo awahitula wana Seluya kugamba, “Miye hina mbuli na nyuwe, nii mwaketenda kunda wank'hondo wangu dyelo? Togoleni kukomigwa mnt'hu yeyose mwe Izilaeli mwe dizuwa dya dyelo? Togola himanyize kugamba miye ni seuta ywa Izilaeli mwe dizuwa dya dyelo?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Niyo seuta amgamba Shimei, “Weye houkomwe Seuta niyo amwikila kilapi Shimei.”<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amlekela Mefibosheti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Mefibosheti mwezukulu dya Sauli, aitaga naho kumsingila seuta Daudi. Kukongela aho seuta ahalawaga Yelusalemu, mpaka aho awiiye vedi, Mefibosheti andaga hanati kusunt'ha viga vakwe na kupucha fili zakwe naho hafigisa zisuke zakwe. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Ivo umwo eze abuile Yelusalemu kwo kumsingila seuta Daudi amuuzaga, “Togola Mefibosheti, nii hundile hamwenga na miye?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Mefibosheti agambaga, “Zumbe ywangu seuta, mndima ywangu anidant'hilizaga. Kwaviya miye mndima ywako, nehimgamba, Niikile lumwe mp'hunda vileke niite hamwenga na seuta, kwaviya miye mndima ywako hiholomp'hala. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Haluse kanidant'hiliza miye, mkulu ywangu seuta. Mna weye mkulu ywangu, kunda enga mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu ywa Mnungu, damanya dyodyose dikukwelela. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Kwaviya mp'huga ya baba nawanda ni want'hu wakuungwa kukomwa ha mkulu ywangu seuta. Mna kuniika hamwenga na wadya wakudya nk'hande hamwenga na weye. Togola nna uwedi wani utendese vikunileka nigendeele kukulombeza seuta.”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Usekunigambila mbuli zako du. Miye hilamula kugamba weye na Siba nompangilane isi ya Sauli.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mna Mefibosheti amgambaga seuta, “Mlekele Siba aiguhe isi yose yehe ekedu. Miye hyelelwa kale kugamba weye seuta kuuya kaya kwa utondowazi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi amdamanyila uwedi Bazilai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Bazilai Mgileadi andaga kabula kulawa Logeilimu. Andaga kaita hamwenga na seuta mwo mto Yolodani vileke amdendeluse mto Yolodani. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Balizilai andaga kadalahala vitendese, mta miyaka milongo mnane. Balizilai andaga akamtendela uwedi seuta uko andaga Mahanaimu, kwaviya andaga mgoli vitendese. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Ivo, seuta Daudi amgambaga Balizilai, “Kiitanye uko Yelusalemu na miye nohulele vedi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Mna Balizilai amgambaga seuta, “Togola nna miyaka mingi yo kwikala vikuleka niite hamwenga na weye Yelusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Miye dyelo nna miyaka mlongo mnane. Togola nna udahi wa kubunk'hula ayedi na yaihile? Togola miye mndima ywako, nadaha kubunk'hula kiya hudya hegu kunywa? Togola nenidahe kutambula uwedi wa maizwi ya wakemi wa kigosi hegu wa kivele? Nii miye mndima ywako ninde enga nt'hanu kwako mkulu ywangu seuta? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Miye mndima ywako neniite na weye mpaka mwe digundi dya mto Yolodani. Nii seuta anilihe nt'hunyo iyo nk'hulu? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nakulombeza unilekele miye mndima ywako, nibanikile mwo mzi wangu, hagihi na kikuta cha tate na mnala. mna uyu mndima ywako Kimhamu mlekele aite na weye mkulu ywangu, naho mdamanyile dyodyose ukuona ni dyedi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Seuta niyo amgamba, “Kimhamu neniitanye naye, naho nenimadamnyile dodyose dyedi kwako. naho dyodyose ukuunga hudamanyile nohudamanyile.” <verse eid="2SA 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Niho want'hu wose wadendeluka mto Yolodani hamwenga na seuta. Seuta amvikilaga Bazilai na kumnonela, na Bazilai niyo auya kwe kaya yakwe.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wa Yuda na want'hu wa Izilaeli wahigana mwa seuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Seuta agendeelaga mpaka Gileadi, Kimhamu andaga akatimilana naye. Want'hu wose wa Yuda na nusu ya want'hu wa Izilaeli wandaga wakamsindikiza seuta. <verse eid="2SA 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Niyo want'hu wose wa Izilaeli waita kwa seuta na kumgamba, “Nii ndugu zetu want'hu wa Yuda weza kwa kinyele niyo wakuguha weye ne mp'huga yako na watowani wako niyo wamidendelusani mto Yolodani?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Want'hu wa Yuda wawagambaga want'hu wa Izilaeli, “Kwaviya seuta ni ndugu ywetu ywa hagihi. Nii mwaihiwa mwe mbuli ino? Togoleni kidya chochose mwo lupisi lwose kwa upati wa seuta? Hegu togoleni yehe kakiink'ha nt'hunyo yoyose?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Want'hu wa Izilaeli wawahitulaga want'hu wa Yuda, “Kina uwagilwa nk'hanana mlongo mwa seuta, kujink'ha izo mnanazo nyuwe, na hata ya Daudi imwenye. Nii elo nomkibela? Togoleni suwe hachandile want'hu wa nk'hongo kugamba seuta ywetu avuzigwe?” Milosi ya want'hu wa Yuda yandaga itendesa kujink'ha idya ya Waizilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Kusaguka kwa Sheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Kwandaga na mnt'hu yumwenga mwiihi uko Giligali etangwagwa Sheba mwana Bikili ywo lukolo lwa Benjamini. Ivo Sheba niyo atoa gunda akagamba, “Hakihamwenga naye uyo Daudi mwana Yese. Nyuwe want'hu wa Izilaeli, kila yumwenga naafunganye mwe dihema dyakwe!” <verse eid="2SA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Ivo want'hu wose wa Izilaeli niyo wamleka Daudi na kumtimila Sheba mwana Bikili. Mna want'hu wa Yuda wamtimilaga seuta Daudi kwa uhuwilwa kulawa mto Yolodani mpaka mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Ivo niyo Daudi engila kwe kaya yakwe mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu. Seuta awaguhaga wawele wakwe mlongo awo awalekaga wakaule inyumba yakwe, na kuwaika mwe nyumba imwenga mwo wamizi, awalelaga vedi, mna hagonaga nawo. Naivo wavele awo wekalaga mwe nyumba mpaka mwe dizuwa dyo kubanika kwawe, wekalaga enga wavele wafiilwe ni wagosi zawe.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Akajika seuta Daudi niyo amgamba Amasa, “Niduganyile watowani wose wa Yuda kwa lupisi lwa mazuwa matatu, na weye mwenye unde aaho.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Ivo Amasa uyo andaga mkulu ywa watowani hant'hu ha Yoabu, agendaga kuwetanga watowani wa Yuda. Mna niyo hasunguze kuuya mwo lupisi ludya aikilwe ni seuta. <verse eid="2SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi niyo amgamba Abishai, “Haluse Sheba mwana Bikili, naakigaile masulumizo kujink'ha yadya ya Abisalomu. Guha watowani wangu naho mumtimile sema anengile mwe mizi ina gomela niyo anyilika kisekumuona naho.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Abishai niyo afosa hamwenga na Yoabu, Want'hu we dikabila dya Keleti na we dikabila dya Peleti hamwenga na watowani wadahi wose. Awo wose nawahalawa Yelusalemu na kumtimila Sheba mwana Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Weze wabule mwe diiwe dikulu idyo dili uko Gibeoni, Amasa afosaga awasingile. Yoabu andaga kavala valo dya nk'hondo, na mwe divalo idyo nokunda na msipi utozile isime mwe kigudi chakwe ukanda mwe yala yakwe. Yoabu eze abule hagihi, sime yakwe yatomokaga hasi. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu niyo amgamba Amasa, “Togola wivihi ndugu yangu?” Yoabu niyo amtoza Amasa vileke amlamse kwa kumnonela. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Mna Amasa haone sime yandile mwo mkono wa Yoabu. Yoabu niyo amjunga Amasa mwe zinda, utumbo wakwe niyo wafosa kuse niyo abanika. Yoabu havuzagize kumjunga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:10">Niyo Yoabu na nduguye Abishai wagendeela kumbasa Sheba mwana Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Mnt'hu yumwenga ywa Yoabu ezaga hagihi ne kimba cha Amasa, akagamba, “Yeyose akumuunga Yoabu na yeyose akumuunga Daudi, amtimile Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa andaga kalambala mwe sakame yakwe mgati mwe sila ink'hulu. Mna want'hu wombokaga aaho, weze wamuone Amasa wakimalaga, mna yudya mnt'hu eze aone wose weza kukimala aaho, akigalaga ikimba icho kwo mgunda na kukigubika ne suke. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Amasa eze ahauswe mwe sila nk'hulu, watowani wose wagendeelaga kumtimila Yoabu na Sheba mwana Bikili.<verse eid="2SA 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba ombokaga mgatigati mwa makabila yose ya Izilaeli mpaka mwo mzi wa Abeli Beti Maaka. Watowani wose wa lukolo lwa Bikili waduganaga na kumtimila. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Watowani wose wandaga hamwenga na Yoabu wagendaga kuuzunguluka mzi wa Sheba uwo wa Abeli Beti Maaka. Wautemangizaga mzi uwo kwa kuika vifyo va watowani, niyo wakonga kumola lukandula. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Niyo mvele mtuhu mta umanyi evigwagwa akagamba, “Tegelezeni! Tegelezeni! Mgambeni Yoabu eze nilonge naye.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu niyo aita hagihi naye, uyo mvele niyo amgamba, “Togola ni weye Yoabu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoabu niyo amhitula, “Heiye ni miye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yudya mvele niyo amgamba “Nitegeleze miye mndima ywako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:17">Yoabu niyo amgamba “Nakutegeleza,”<verse eid="2SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Uyo mvele niyo amgamba, “Aho kale want'hu wandaga wakagamba, ‘Iteni mkazungule ulangilizi kulawa mwo mzi wa Abeli.’ Nivo want'hu wadahaga kulamula masa yawe. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Miye ni yumwenga mwa wadya wakuunga utondowazi na uhuwilwa mwe Izilaeli. Nii wageza kuubananga mzi uwo wili enga nine dya Iziaeli? Nii waunga uubanange mzi wa Zumbe Mnungu?”<verse eid="2SA 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu niyo amhitula, “Bule.” “Mwo wikazi wangu hyaungile niubanange hegu kuumola pele. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Ivo ulongile hiyo kindedi! Mna eyuko mnt'hu yumwenga kulawa kwe isi ye vigulu va Ifulaimu zuna dyakwe Sheba mwana Bikili, aunga asaguke kwa seuta Daudi. Nink'heni mnt'hu uyo name nenihalawe mwo mzi wenyu.” Yudya mvele niyo amgamba Yoabu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">“Mtwi wakwe neni uduule kombokela mwo lukandula.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Niyo yudya mvele mwo ubala wakwe aitaga kwa want'hu wose akawalangilize. Woho nawo wamkant'haga Sheba umtwi wakwe na kuuduula kuse ya Yoabu. Ivo Yoabu atowaga gunda, na kuwausa want'hu wakwe mwo mzi uwo wa Abeli, kila yumwenga akeitilaga kwe kaya yakwe. Yoabu naye niyo auya kwa seuta uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wambizi wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoabu andaga mkulu ywe difyo dyose dya watowani wa Izilaeli. Beneya mwana Yehoyada andaga mkulu ywa Wakeleti na Wapeleti awo wandaga wamizi wakwe. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adolamu andaga mkimalizi ywe zindima zo kutigizwa, Yehoshafati andaga niye naaka wandika zink'humbukila. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Shausha andaga mwandisi, Sadoki na Abiatali nawo wandaga walavant'hambiko, <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />Ila naye kulawa Yaili andaga mlavant'hambiko ywa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Welekwa wa Sauli wakomwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Mwo lupisi lutuhu nokulaila gumbo itendese mwo useuta wa Daudi. Sala iyo neinda ya miyaka mitatu. Daudi amlombezaga Mnungu, Zumbe Mnungu naye niyo amgamba, “Sauli na want'hu wakwe wana masa ya ukomi kwaviya wawakomaga Wagibeoni.”<verse eid="2SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Ivo seuta Daudi niyo awetanga Wagibeoni na kulonga nawo. Wagibioni awa hawandaga Waizilaeli, mna wandaga ni Waamoli wasigalaga. Izilaeli waikaga kilapi kuwaleka kunda wagima, mna Sauli agezaga kuwakoma wose kwaviya andaga akawaungisa Waizilaeli na want'hu wa Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Daudi niyo awauza Wagibeoni, “Niwadamanyilei? Nenilihize vivihi kwa uwihi mdamanyilwe niho muwavikile isi na want'hu wa Zumbe Mnungu?”<verse eid="2SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Wagibeoni niyo wamgamba, “Nk'humbizi yetu suwe na Sauli ne mp'huga yakwe hakikuunga kulihigwa masawa hegu zahabu, hegu kukome mnt'hu yeyose mwe isi ya Izilaeli.” Seuta niyo awauza naho,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">“Haluse mwaunga niwadamanyileni mbwai?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Woho niyo wamgamba seuta, “Sauli nakaunga kukikoma suwe asekusigaza hata mnt'hu yumwenga mwe isi yose ya Izilaeli. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Ivo, kink'he want'hu mfungate mwa welekwa wakwe we kilume, naswe kiwanyogotole ha Zumbe Mnungu mwo mnima wa Gibea, kwo mzi wa Sauli seuta asagulwe ni Zumbe Mnungu.” Seuta niyo awagamba,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">“Neniwenk'hize want'hu awo kwenyu.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Mna seuta amhonyaga Mefibosheti mwana Yonasani kwajili ya kilapi icho Daudi na Yonasani mwana Sauli waikilanaga ha Zumbe Mnungu. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Mna seuta awaguhaga wana waidi awo Lisipa mwana kike ywa Ahiya amwelekele Sauli, Amoni na Mefibosheti, hamwenga na wana wose wa kilume wa Mikali, mwana kike ywa Sauli uyo amwelekele Aduleli mwana Bazilai ywe dikabila dya Wameholati. <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />Daudi awenk'hizaga kwa Wagibeoni, awo welekwa we kilume mfungate, Wagibioni nawo wawahwelezaga want'hu awo mwo mnima hant'hu ha kumvika Zumbe Mnungu. Wose mfungate niyo wabanika hamwenga. Want'hu awo wakomagwa mwe nk'hongelo yo uvuni we shaili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Niyo Lisipa mwanakike ywa Ahia aguhaga valo dya gunia, no kuketandikila mwo luwe. Ekalaga aho kukongela mwo uvuni mpaka aho fula yavinyeelaga ivimba. Havilekaga ivimba ivo vibanangwe ni ndege nyika hegu ni makala matuhu nekilo. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Daudi eze eve yadya adamanye Lisipa mwanakie ywa Aya, muwele ywa Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />agendaga kuguha mavuha ya Sauli na Yonasani mwanawe kulawa mwa wakaya wa Yabeshi Gileadi. Mavuha ayo wayabawaga kulawa mwo lwazo lwa want'hu wose uko Beti Sheani, aho Wafilisiti wamhwelezaga Sauli na Yonasani mwe dizuwa diya Wafilisiti wamkomaga Sauli mwo mnima Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Ivo, Daudi ayavuza mavuha ya Sauli na Yonasani uyo mwanawe kulawa uko, naho ayaduganyaga mavuha ya wabwanga mfungate awo wahwelezwagwa. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Ivo want'hu wa Daudi niyo wayamosela msanga mavuha ya Sauli na Yonasani uyo mwanawe mwe isi ya Benjamini uko Sela mwe kikuta cha Kishi ise dya Sauli. Wadamanyaga kila kint'hu enga ivo seuta agambaga vidamanywe. Yeze yajike ayo, Mnungu awevaga kulombeza kwawe kwajili ye isi yawe.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nk'hondo ya Wafilisiti na Waizilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Niyo Wafilisiti watowana nk'hondo na Waizilaeli naho. Daudi naye na watowani wakwe wagendaga kutowana nawo, uko Daudi asokelesaga. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Ishibi Benobu, yumwenga mwa welekwa wa mazint'hu, uyo andaga na mjungo wa shaba wandaga wa kilo nt'hatu na nusu, akevalaga sime mp'ya, agambaga naamkome Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Mna Abishai mwana Seluya, agendaga kumwambiza Daudi, Abishai amtowaga yudya Mfilisiti na kumkoma, ivo, watowani wamwikilaga kilapi Daudi wakagamba, “Hekiitanye na weye naho kwe nk'hondo. Weye niwe dikawiilo dyetu hakikuunga kukwaza.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Ize yajike nk'hondo iyo, kwalailaga nk'hondo nt'huhu na Wafilisiti uko Gobu. Uko Sibekai Mhushati, amkomaga Safu uyo andaga yumwenga ywa welekwa wa mazint'hu we dikabila dya Lefai.<verse eid="2SA 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Nokulaila naho nk'hondo na Wafilisiti uko Gobu. Elinani mwana Yaaleo Ligimu uyo Mbetelehemu amkomaga Goliati Mgiti, uwo mjungo wakwe wandaga na mhini mkulu enga mfunda wa lusazi.<verse eid="2SA 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Niyo naho kwalaila nk'hondo nt'huhu uko Gati. Kwandaga na zint'hu kulu, dyandaga na madole mtandatu mwe kila mkono wakwe na kiga chakwe. Uwazilo wa madole yakwe yose dyandaga na madole milongo miidi na mane. Dyoho nadyo dyandaga mwo welekwa wa mazint'hu ayo. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Umwo dyandaga dikawabela Waizilaeli Yonasani mwana ywa Shimei nduguye Daudi adikomaga.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Awane awo wandaga welekwa wa mazint'hu uko Gati, awo nawo wakomwagwa ni Daudi hamwenga na watowani wakwe.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa uhumi wa Daudi Zab 18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daudi amkemelaga wila Zumbe Mnungu ulosi uno mwe dizuwa diya Zumbe Mnungu amkombolaga mwo udahi wa wank'hondo wakwe wose na mwo udahi wa Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Zumbe Mnungu niye mwamizi ywangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">ni unyilikilo wangu utogile.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Mnungu ywangu niye mwamizi ywangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">miye nakefisa kwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">anamila miye enga nk'hindilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">yehe ni mwamizi ywangu, na unyilikilo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Yehe niye myokozi ywangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">anamila na kuniyokola kulawa mwa waihi.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />Namwitanga Zumbe Mnungu awagilwe kutogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">name nayokolwa kulawa mwa wank'hondo wangu,<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Kwaviya mjubwaniso wa file wanizungulukaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">malao ya ubanangi nayanigubika,<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />File nayo yanizilaga hagihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">kikuta nekikanongola.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />Mwe makunt'ho yangu nehimwitanga Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">nehimwitanga Mnungu vileke anambize.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">Umo mwe nyumba ya mviko adivaga diizwi dyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">anitegelezaga umwo haiila wambizi.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Aho isi niyo yazingiza na kusingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">mikola ya kwe mbingu niyo yazingiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">kwaviya Mnungu engilaga maya.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Mosi wafunk'haga kulawa mwe zimp'hula zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">moto ukoka walawaga mwo mnomo wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">nk'hala zo moto zalawaga mwakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Aupangaga ulanga niyo aseela hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">niyo kwanda na vunde dititihale hasi ye viga vakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Akwelaga mnanga mwe kiumbwa kina mawawa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">kikwitangwa kelubi niyo apuuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">ayeyaga enga dege mwo ulanga.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Akezungulusilaga ziza dititihale nt'hendelo zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">ngubiko yakwe yandaga mavunde yazamile ya fula.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Lumwemwe lwamwekaga ha hakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">nk'hala za moto niyo zakim'puka.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Zumbe Mnungu ant'hint'hilaga kulawa kwe mbingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">izwi dyakwe uyo ekulanga vitendese niyo dyevika.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Awalasaga wank'hondo misale niyo awazaganya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">na kuwatimula kwa lukuwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Zumbe Mnungu eze awativile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kwa muye we zimp'hula zakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">mazi matali ye bahali nayagubulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">nk'hongelo ye isi niyo yaoneka.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />Mnungu achululaga mkono wakwe kulawa kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">aniguhaga kulawa mwa mazi mengi na kuniinula.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Aniyokolaga kulawa mwa wank'hondo wangu wata udahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">aniyokolalaga mwa awo nawakaniihiya kwaviya wandaga na ludole lukulu lwa kunihuma.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Nawanikump'hukila umwo nandile na makunt'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">mna Zumbe Mnungu kanamila.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Aniguhaga na kunigala hant'hu haheina nk'humbizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">aniyokolaga kwaviya nakaniungisa miye,<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />Zumbe Mnungu nakanigeleka viligane na uhuwilwa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">aniamilaga miye kwaviya haina masa.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Kwaviya hitimila sila ya Zumbe Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">naho hikepagule na Mnungu ywangu kwa wiihi.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Hitoza sigilizi zakwe zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">hilekile kutimila malagizo yakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Kulongole kwakwe hina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">hikeamila nisekunda na masa.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Zumbe Mnungu kanigeleka kwaviya hina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">yehe kamanya uwedi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />Weye umhuwilwa kwa wadya wahuwilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">uywedi kwa wadya weli wedi.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Weye wakelagisa huna masa kwa wadya heweina masa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">mna walagisa kuwaihia wadya waihi.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Weye wawayokola wajalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">mna wawakaula wata kuketunya na kuwaseleza.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />E Zumbe Mnungu ni lumuli lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Mnungu ywangu ukuhausa ziza dyangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />kwa wambizi wako wawatowa mafyo ya wank'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">weye wanink'ha udahi wa kupuluka nk'handula zakwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />Akudamanya Mnungu hakina lema</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Ndagano ya Zumbe Mnungu ni ya kindedi.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Niani eli Mnungu uneva hiyo Zumbe Mnungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Niani eli luwe lwa kunyilikila vituhu vakwe ni Mnungu ywetu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Mnungu uyu niye unyilikilo wangu utogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">naho kaidamanya sila yangu inde heiina nk'huswank'huswa.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Katogeza viga vangu enga va nt'wika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">na kuniika vedi kulanga kwo lunenengwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Anihinyiza kutowana nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">mikono yangu idahe kuvuta uta wa shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Kunamila na kunikombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">wambizi wako kuutenda mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Kuitenda sila yangu kunda na nk'uswank'huswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">naho viga vangu haviteele.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />Nihiwatimila wank'hondo wangu na kuwakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">hiuiye kunyuma mpaka aho nawakomile.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Nehiwakinya na kuwakoma wasekudaha kwinuka naho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">wagwagwa hasi ye viga vangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Weye wanink'haga udahi wa kutowana kwe nk'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">wawaikaga wank'hondo wangu hasi yo udahi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Kuwatenda wank'hondo wangu wanyilike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">na wadya nawakaniihya nehiwakoma.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Wazungulaga wambizi mna hakwandaga namnt'hu wa kuwakombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">wamwiilaga Mnungu mna hawahitule.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Nehiwahonda na kuwahondesa enga msanga we isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">nehiwahonda na kuwajata enga nt'hope mwe sila.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />Weye kuniyokola na makunt'ho ya want'hu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">kunitenda kunda kilongozi ywe ziisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">want'hu hiwa manyize nawanidamanyila ndima.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Wata kwiza naweza wakakeseleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">weze weve mbuli zangu nawanizumila.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Wata kwiza nawengila chefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">wezaga kulawa mwe magomela yawe wakazingiza.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />Zumbe Mnungu mta udahi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Atunywe mwamizi ywangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">Atunywe Mnungu ywangu, unyilikilo wo uyokozi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Yehe kanitenda nidahe kuliha kilapi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">na kuziika isi mwo udahi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Kanikombola kulawa mwa wank'hondo wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">Zumbe Mnungu, kunk'ha uhumi mwa wank'hondo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">na kuniika hale mwa want'hu waihile.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Ivo nohutunye mwa want'hu wa isi nt'huhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">nohukemele mila haditogola dizina dyako.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Mnungu amwink'haga uhumi mkulu seuta ywakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">na kumlagisa lukunde lwakwe kwa uyo amsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">Heiye, amwink'haga lukunde Daudi na welekwa wakwe mazuwa yose.<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa kubindiliza wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Ukutimila nuwo ulosi wa kubindiliza wa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">Mwana Yese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">ulosi wa mnt'hu uyo Mnungu amtendile ande mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">Mnungu ywa Yakobo amsagule Daudi kunda seuta na ulosi wakwe mwe Izilaeli wayaungisaga kuyakema.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />Muye ywa Mnungu alonga kombokela kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">aikaga ulosi mwo mnomo wangu,<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Mnungu ywa Izilaeli kagamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">mwamizi ywa Izilaeli agamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">“Seuta akuwalongoza want'hu kwa ivo vikuungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">alongoza kwa kumogaha Mnungu,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />yehe ni enga ungazi wa mtondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">zuwa dikant'hont'homoka hediina mavunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">heye enga fula ikutenda mani yahote mwe isi.”<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />Ivo nivo Mnungu avikile imp'huga yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Kwaviya kadamanya Ndagano ya mazuwa yose na miye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Ndagano yedi naho ikint'hile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Yehe nae naakint'hize yose yadya huyaunga.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Mna wose hewemmanyize Mnungu ni enga miwa ikuduulwa du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">kwaviya heikudahika kuguhigwa kwa mkono,<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />kutoza vaungwa utoze na kilama hegu mhini wa mjungo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Want'hu awo nawokigwe pele.<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watowani wadahi wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Ulu nulo ludongo lwa watowani wadahi andaga nawo Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:8">Yosheb Bashebeti ywe dikabila dya Takimoni, andaga kilongozi mwa wadya watatu. yehe atoanaga kwa mjungo wakwe, na kuwakoma want'hu magana mnane mwo lupisi lumwenga.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Atimilaga mwa wadya watowani watatu andaga Eleazali mwana Dodo ywa lukolo lwa Wahohi. Zuwa dimwenga Eleazali andaga hamwenga na Daudi umwo wandaga wakawahomola Wafilisiti awo wandaga wakeduganya watowane nk'hondo. Waizilaeli wawanyilikaga Wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Mna Eleazali akimalaga atogile na kutowana na Wafilisiti vatendaga mkono wakwe walelaga, niyo wanda unamatila mwe sime yakwe. Mwe dizuwa idyo Zumbe Mnungu kakepatila uhumi mkulu. Nk'hondo ize ikimale Waizilaeli wauyaga kudya andaga Eliyazali na kutaha vitahigwa kulawa mwa Wafilisiti wakomigwe.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Mtowani mtuhu ywa katatu andaga Shama mwana ywa Agee, Mhalali. Wafilisiti waduganaga uko Lehi, hant'hu handaga na mgunda wa dengu zibindile ingi, Waizilaeli woho wawanyilikaga wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Mna uyo Shama akimalaga atogile mgatigati mwo mgunda uwo vileke aukindile, niyo awakoma Wafilisiti. Zumbe Mnungu niyo anda mhumi mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Niyo watowani watatu mwa wadya wakulu milongo mitatu, waseelega mwo msimo wo uvuni niyo wambwiila Daudi mwe mp'hanga uko Adulamu. Mwo lupisi ulwo watowani dya Wafilisiti dyandaga ditowa nk'hambi uko kwe dikolongo dya Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Daudi naye mwo lupisi ulwo andaga mwe digomela umwo mwandaga na wamizi mkulu, difyo dya watowani dya Wafilisiti nadyo dyandaga mwo mzi wa Betelehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi niyo alonga kwa nk'hwina akudaha kunink'ha mazi, “Hegu nevinda vedi mnt'hu yumwenga anigaile mazi ya kunywa kulawa mwe disima dya Betelehemu, idyo dyandaga hagihi ne nk'hili ya Yelusalemu!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Wadya watowani wakwe watatu wafosaga, wakehenyezaga mgatigati mwe nk'hambi ya Wafilisiti niyo wagenda kuteka mazi mwe disima dya Betelehemu hagihi ne nk'hili yo mzi, na kumwigaila Daudi. Mna Daudi alemelaga kuyanywa amazi ayo, vituhu vakwe ayetilaga hasi enga nt'hambiko kwa Zumbe Mnungu, <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />akagamba, “Zumbe Mnungu, miye hina uwagilwa wowose wa kunywa mazi aya, togola mazi aya hi enga sakame ya wadya wazumilaga hata kubanika?” Ivo Daudi hayanywaga mazi ayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Izo nizo zimbuli wadamanye watowani awo watatu.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Abishai nduguye Yoabu, mwana Seluya, andaga mkulu ywa watowani milongo mitatu. Yehe atowanaga na mjungo wakwe mwa want'hu magana matatu na kuwakoma, niyo anda katogoleswa mwa wadya watowani watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Andaga kamanyikisa mwa wadya watowani milongo mitatu, ivo niyo anda mkulu ywawe, mna hamanyikisaga kujink'ha wadya watatu.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya mwana Yehoyada naye kulawa Kabizeli andaga mtowani mdahi, naho adamanyaga mbuli nyingi za vihungi. Awakomaga watowani waidi kulawa Moabu, naho zuwa dimwenga mwo lupisi lwe mp'heho itendese, aseelaga mwe dibome niyo akuikoma isimba. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Iviyaiviya adikomaga zint'hu dya Misili. Mmisili uyo andaga na mjungo, mna Benaya amwitilaga akanda na lungu du, amhokaga mjungo uwo na kumkoma Mmisili uyo kwa mjungo wakwe mwenye. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Beneya mwana ywa Yehoyada adamanyaga mbuli izi, na kuketunya mwa wadya watowani watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Ivo andaga mtowani mdahi mwa wadya watowani milongo mitatu, ikanda handile enga wadya watowani watatu. Na Daudi amwink'haga ukulu wo wamizi wakwe mwenye.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Asaheli nduguye Yoabu andaga yumwenga ywa watowani milongo mitatu. Watowani watuhu wa Daudi wandaga, Elihanani mwana ywa Dodo ywa Betelehemu, <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />Shama na Elika kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Mhalodi, <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />Helesi na Mpaliti na Ila na mwana wa Ikeshi kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Mtekoa <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />Abiezeli na Mwanathothi na Mebunai kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Mhushathi <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />Salmoni na Mwahohi na Mahalai kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Mnetofathi <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />Helebu mwana ywa Baana kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Mnetofathi; Itai mwana ywa Libai, kulawa Gibea mwa Benjamini, <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />Benaya na Mpilathoni na Hidai wa vizito vya Gaashi, <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />Abialiboni na Mwalibathi na Azimawethi, kulawa mw lukolo kwa Mbahulimu, <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />Eliyaba na Mshaalboni na wana ywa Yasheni; Yonasani, <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />Shama na Mhalali na Ahimu mwana ywa Shalali kulawa mwo lukolo lwa Mhalali, <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />Elifeleti mwana ywa Ahasbai kulawa Mmaaka; Eliyamu mwana ywa Ahithofeli kulawa Mgiloni, <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />Hezilawi ywe dikabila dya Wakalimeli; Paalai, Mwalibi, <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />Igali mwana ywa Nasani kulawa Soba; Bani kulawa Gadiadi, <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />Seleki na Mwamoni na Nahalai na Mbeelothi wandaga wenula vitowanilo wa Yoabu mwana Seluya,<verse eid="2SA 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />Ila na Galebu, kulawa mwe dikabika dya Waithli,<verse eid="2SA 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na Ulia uyo Mhiti. Wose hamwenga wandaga watowani wadahi milongo mitatu na mfungate.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi awawaza Waizilaeli na Wayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Zumbe Mnungu awaihiyaga Waizilaeli vituhu. Amtendaga Daudi awasulumize, Zumbe amgambaga “ Wawaze want'hu wa Izilaeli na want'hu wa Yuda.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Ivo seuta niyo amgamba Yoabu na wakulu wa mafyo ya watowani yose yandile hamwenga naye, “Iteni kwa makabila yose ya izilaeli kulawa Dani mpaka Beel Sheba, mkawawaze want'hu nimanye uwazilo wawe.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Mna Yoabu niyo amgamba seuta, “Zumbe Mnungu ywako, awongezele watowani wakwe nk'hanana gana kujink'ha ivo weli ivi haluse, weye nawe mkulu ukaule mgenyezo uwo weye mwenye. Mna nii weye mkulu welelwa na mbuli ino?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Mna ulosi wa seuta nounda na udahi kujink'ha wa Yoabu na wakulu wa watowani wadahi we difyo, ivo Yoabu na watowani we difyo niyo wahalawa ha seuta na kugenda kuwawaza Waizilaeli.<verse eid="2SA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Wadendelukaga mto Yolodani na kuika kank'hambi kwa mwenye mzi wa Aloeli mzi uhagati ye dikolongo mwe isi ya Gadi kulawa aho wahingaga kasikazini ya Yazeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Niyo waita Gileadi na Kadeshi mwe isi ya Wahiti, naho waitaga Dani na kulawa Dani wazungulukaga kuita isi ya Sidoni, <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />na mpaka kwe digomela dyo mzi wa Tilo, wengilaga mwe mizi yose ya Wahivi na Wakanaani. Niyo wahalawa kuita kwa mwenye mzi ya Yuda uko Beel Sheba.<verse eid="2SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Umwo yombokaga miezi kenda na mazuwa milongo miidi, wabindaga kugenda mwe isi yose, niyo wauya Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Niyo Yoabu amwigaila seuta uwazilo wa want'hu. Mwe Izilaeli nokunda na wagosi wakudaha kutowana nk'hondo laki mnane, mwe isi ya Yuda nokunda na wagosi laki shano wana udahi wa kuita kwe nk'hondo.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Mna Daudi mwo moyo wakwe nokunda na kiyangayanga umwo wajikaga kuwawaza want'hu. Ivo Daudi amgambaga Zumbe Mnungu, “Hidamanya wavu mkulu mwe mbuli ino nidamanye. Mna haluse Zumbe Mnungu, nakulombeza unilekele miye mndima ywako, kwaviya hidamanya mbuli ya kihezi vitendese.”<verse eid="2SA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Daudi umwo andile akei kwinuka, mwo lupisi ulwo Zumbe Mnungu amwink'haga ulosi mlotezi Gadi ywa seuta Daudi, akagamba. <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Ita ukamgambile Daudi ivi. ‘Zumbe Mnungu agamba, nakwink'ha mbuli izi nt'hatu, kesaguile imwenga weye mwenye na miye nohutendele.’”<verse eid="2SA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Ivo Gadi niyo aita kwa Daudi na kumgamba, “Togola waunga sala ya miyaka mfungate ize mwe isi yako? Hegu weye uwanyilike wank'hondo wako kwa miyaka mitatu wakakutimila? Hegu kunde na maine yaihile? Fanyanya unink'he uhituzi vileke nimwigaile yudya anisigiile.”<verse eid="2SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi niyo amhitula Gadi, “Nina wogohi mkulu! Mna vaungwa nisengelwe ni Zumbe Mnungu, kujink'ha kuikwa mwo udahi wa want'hu kwaviya yehe ana mbazi zitendese.”<verse eid="2SA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Ivo Zumbe Mnungu niyo awegaila Waizilaeli manyonge yaihile, kukongela mtondo mpaka lupisi luikigwe. Want'hu alufu milongo mfungate wabanikaga mwe isi yose kulawa Dani mpaka Beel Sheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Mna umwo mtumigwa ywa kwe mbingu eze achulule mkono wakwe kuhinga mwo mzi wa Yelusalemu vileke aubanange, Zumbe Mnungu ahitulaga ulamuzi wakwe. Zumbe Mnungu niyo amgamba yudya mtumigwa uyo naakaunga aubalange umzi uwo, “Leka, vuza mkono wako!” Mtumigwa ywa Zumbe Mnungu andaga kakimala hagihi na hant'hu ha kuhutila ulozo wa Alauna uyo Myebusi.<verse eid="2SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi eze amuone uyo mtumigwa akuwakoma want'hu, amgambaga Zumbe Mnungu, “Kaula miye ni miye mta masa! Awa want'hu wajalamu hawadamanye wavu. Nakulombeza vitendese unisengele miye hamwenga ne mp'huga yangu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Mwe dizuwa idyo Gadi aitaga kwa Daudi akamgamba, “Kwela kukenya kwe kiwasa ukamzengele Zumbe Mnungu kilingo, mwa hant'hu ha kiwasa cha kuhutila ulozo cha Alauna uyo Myebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Ivo Daudi akwelaga kukenya enga ivo alongile Gadi naivo Zumbe Mnungu amsigiile. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Alauna eze akaule mondwaisi amuonaga seuta akanda hagihi hamwenga na wandima wakwe, yehe naye niyo aita kwa seuta kufunamiza mtwi wakwe hasi kwa kumtunya.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Niyo Alauna amuuza seuta, “Nii zumbe ywangu kaniiziila miye mndima ywakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:21">Daudi niyo amgamba “Hiza nigule kiwasa chako cha kuhutila ulozo vileke nimzengele Zumbe Mnungu kilingo vileke naho manyonge yawapatile want'hu wako yasile.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Alauna naye niyo amgamba Daudi, “Mkulu ywangu seuta, guha chosechose kiya ukuona chedi kilavigwe malavo. Miye nalava njeku izi kunda malavo ya kokwa na vint'hu ivi va kuhutila ulozo na ziya zikutoza magembe kunda nk'huni.” <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Seuta ivo vose nakwink'ha, “Zumbe Mnungu ywako akuzumile.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Mna seuta niyo amgamba Alauna, “Bule! weye hounink'he bule, miye nenivigule kwako kwa yombe dyakwe. Henimlavile Zumbe Mnungu, malavo ya kokwa ayo hayeena yombe.” Ivo seuta Daudi niyo agula kiwasa cha kuhutila ulozo na njeku kwa vibesu milongo mishano va masawa. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Akaheza seuta Daudi niyo amzengela Zumbe Mnungu kilingo cha kumlavila malavo ya kokwa. Ivo Zumbe Mnungu niyo azumila malombezo ayo kwaajili ya Waizilaeli, na malombezo ya mavuma mwe isi ya Izilaeli yose niyo yasila.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>